ente a producción?","options":["Pedir a autores que lo arreglen","Seguir el pipeline con la corrección mínima","Saltarse stage","Editar /apps en producción"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Hotfix process.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What if an urgent fix must reach production?","options":["Ask authors to fix it","Run the pipeline with the minimal fix","Skip stage","Edit /apps in production"],"explanation":"Hotfix process."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué indica el estado \"cancelled\" de una ejecución de pipeline?","options":["Terminó correctamente","Está en cola","Está en producción","Se detuvo antes de terminar"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Estados.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does a cancelled pipeline execution mean?","options":["It finished fine","It's queued","It's in production","It stopped before finishing"],"explanation":"States."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene comprobar tras un despliegue a producción?","options":["Nada; el pipeline lo garantiza todo","Monitorización, logs y funcionamiento clave","Solo el color del sitio","El número de commits incluidos en el despliegue"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Post-deploy checks.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What should be checked after a production deploy?","options":["Nothing; the pipeline guarantees all","Monitoring, logs and key functionality","Only site color","The number of commits in the deployment"],"explanation":"Post-deploy checks."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene si el índice personalizado tarda en reindexar y bloquea el despliegue?","options":["Borrar el índice en producción","Ignorarlo, porque el reindexado nunca afecta al despliegue","Planificar el cambio y revisar la definición del índice","Desactivar el pipeline"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Index planning.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What if a custom index reindex is slow and blocks deploy?","options":["Delete the index in production","Ignore it, as reindexing never affects deploys","Plan the change and