ips between classes."}}},{"domain":"D1","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos datos suelen modelarse como ExperienceEvent? (Elige 2)","options":["Nombre","Visitas a página","Fecha de nacimiento","Compras","Dirección postal"],"correct":[1,3],"explanation":"Interacciones con marca temporal.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two data types are usually modeled as ExperienceEvent? (Choose 2)","options":["Name","Page views","Birth date","Purchases","Postal address"],"explanation":"Timestamped interactions."}}},{"domain":"D1","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene documentar del modelo XDM?","options":["Contraseñas","Solo el nombre del sandbox donde se creó cada esquema","Solo el nombre del sandbox","Esquemas, identidades y uso de cada campo"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Diccionario de datos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What should be documented about the XDM model?","options":["Passwords","Only the sandbox name where each schema was created","Only the sandbox name","Schemas, identities and each field's use"],"explanation":"A data dictionary."}}},{"domain":"D1","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué recurso de Adobe ayuda a diseñar un ERD para XDM?","options":["Un informe de Analytics","Un informe de Analytics con las variables más utilizadas","Las guías de modelado de datos de Experience League","Un destino"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Documentación de buenas prácticas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which Adobe resource helps design an ERD for XDM?","options":["An Analytics report","An Analytics report with the most-used variables","Experience League data modeling guides","A destination"],"explanation":"Best-practice documentation."}}},{"domain":"D1","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ocurre si dos esquemas de la misma clase definen el mismo campo personalizado con tipos distintos?","options":["Se produce conflicto en el esquema de unión","Se combinan automáticamente","Se ignora uno","Se combinan automáticamente usando el tipo más genérico"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"La unión requiere tipos coherentes.",