ronments?","options":["Anonymize or use synthetic data","Copy real data as-is for more realistic tests","Publish it","Nothing"],"explanation":"Personal data must be protected in testing too."}}},{"domain":"D1","source":"bank","stem":"Un error intermitente aparece en producción y no se reproduce en test. ¿Qué hace el lead?","options":["Nada","Recoger logs y patrones de ocurrencia para aislar condiciones","Reiniciar todo cada hora","Cerrar la incidencia porque no se reproduce"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Los patrones (hora, usuario, datos) revelan la causa.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"An intermittent error appears in production and can't be reproduced in test. What does the lead do?","options":["Nothing","Gather logs and occurrence patterns to isolate conditions","Restart everything hourly","Close the ticket since it can't be reproduced"],"explanation":"Patterns (time, user, data) reveal the cause."}}},{"domain":"D1","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué indica un error de \"missing precedents\" al importar en producción si la inspección en test pasó?","options":["Nada","Diferencias entre entornos (objetos que existen en test pero no en prod)","Un error de red","Que el paquete se corrompió en la descarga y debe exportarse de nuevo siempre"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Los entornos pueden divergir; hay que inspeccionar contra el destino real.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does a \"missing precedents\" error on prod import mean if test inspection passed?","options":["Nothing","Environment drift (objects in test but not prod)","Network error","The package got corrupted on download and must always be re-exported"],"explanation":"Environments can drift; inspect against the real target."}}},{"domain":"D1","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos acciones previenen la deriva entre entornos? (Elige 2)","options":["Copias manuales de objetos","Ignorar avisos","Permitir que los desarrolladores editen directamente en producción","Cambios solo por despliegue","Comparaciones periódicas entre entornos"