r? (Elige 2)","options":["Uso de memoria de motores","Color del tema","El número de iconos usados en las interfaces de la aplicación","Errores de procesos y tiempos de respuesta","Longitud de nombres"],"correct":[0,3],"explanation":"Memoria, errores y tiempos reflejan la salud del entorno.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two environment metrics should be watched? (Choose 2)","options":["Engine memory usage","Theme color","The number of icons used in the app's interfaces","Process errors and response times","Name length"],"explanation":"Memory, errors and timings reflect environment health."}}},{"domain":"D1","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué hace un lead ante una incidencia grave en producción?","options":["Nada","Buscar al culpable antes de investigar la causa","Desplegar cambios sin probar para arreglarlo","Coordinar diagnóstico, comunicación y solución"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"El foco es restaurar el servicio y comunicar.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does a lead do during a serious production incident?","options":["Nothing","Find someone to blame before investigating","Deploy untested changes to fix it","Coordinate diagnosis, communication and fix"],"explanation":"The focus is restoring service and communicating."}}},{"domain":"D1","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué es un post-mortem y qué aporta?","options":["Un informe para identificar qué persona causó el problema","Nada","Un log","Un análisis tras una incidencia para evitar que se repita"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Se centra en causas y mejoras, sin culpables.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's a post-mortem and what does it bring?","options":["A report identifying which person caused the issue","Nothing","A log","An analysis after an incident to prevent recurrence"],"explanation":"It focuses on causes and improvements, blameless."}}},{"domain":"D1","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos medidas permiten un hotfix urgente sin saltarse el control? (Elige 2)","options":["Pruebas mínimas acordadas en entorno previo","Desactivar 