bar UAT solo","Escribir personalmente todas las historias de usuario del backlog","Aprobar despliegues a entornos superiores"],"correct":[1,4],"explanation":"El lead actúa como garante de la calidad de los despliegues.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two deployment responsibilities does the lead usually take? (Choose 2)","options":["Designing logos","Reviewing package contents","Doing UAT alone","Personally writing every user story in the backlog","Approving deployments to higher environments"],"explanation":"The lead safeguards deployment quality."}}},{"domain":"D1","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene hacer con los usuarios de prueba creados en entornos superiores?","options":["Compartir sus contraseñas","Mantenerlos activos con permisos amplios por si se necesitan","Gestionarlos y eliminarlos o desactivarlos tras las pruebas","Nada"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Las cuentas de prueba son un riesgo si se olvidan.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What should be done with test users created in higher environments?","options":["Share their passwords","Keep them active with broad rights in case needed","Manage and remove/deactivate them after testing","Nothing"],"explanation":"Forgotten test accounts are a risk."}}},{"domain":"D1","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de información NO debe incluirse en un paquete de despliegue?","options":["Scripts de base de datos","Credenciales en texto plano","Archivos de personalización sin secretos","Objetos de diseño de la aplicación"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Las credenciales se configuran en destino de forma segura.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What information must NOT be included in a deployment package?","options":["Database scripts","Plain-text credentials","Customization files without secrets","App design objects"],"explanation":"Credentials are set securely in the target."}}},{"domain":"D1","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos prácticas facilitan auditar quién cambió qué en una aplicación? (Elige 2)","options":["Historial de versiones de obj