ué dos herramientas apoyan la colaboración técnica en un equipo Appian? (Elige 2)","options":["Cuentas compartidas","Documentación de arquitectura accesible","Cambios sin comunicar","Revisiones de diseño compartidas","Conocimiento solo en una persona"],"correct":[1,3],"explanation":"Compartir conocimiento mejora la calidad.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two tools support technical collaboration in an Appian team? (Choose 2)","options":["Shared accounts","Accessible architecture docs","Uncommunicated changes","Shared design reviews","Knowledge in one person only"],"explanation":"Sharing knowledge improves quality."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué patrón ayuda a gestionar textos legales que cambian por normativa?","options":["Constantes","Texto copiado en cada interfaz y editado a mano","Documentos o configuración versionados por fecha","Nada"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Versionar permite saber qué texto aplicaba en cada momento.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which pattern helps manage legal texts that change by regulation?","options":["Constants","Text copied into each interface and hand-edited","Documents or config versioned by date","Nothing"],"explanation":"Versioning shows which text applied when."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene cuando una nueva funcionalidad afecta a varias aplicaciones?","options":["Nada","Que cada equipo la implemente a su manera","Hacerla en una sola sin avisar","Coordinar diseño y despliegue entre equipos"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Coordinar evita inconsistencias.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's advisable when a new feature affects several apps?","options":["Nothing","Each team implements it their own way","Build it in one without notice","Coordinate design and deployment across teams"],"explanation":"Coordination avoids inconsistency."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos elementos componen una buena definición de componente compartido? (Elige 2)","options":["Parámetros ambiguos","Descripció