ort each item","Nothing"],"explanation":"View, edit and export are distinct vectors."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos decisiones de diseño mejoran la experiencia en tareas repetitivas? (Elige 2)","options":["Pantallas intermedias innecesarias","Valores por defecto inteligentes","Pedir los mismos datos varias veces","Confirmaciones en cada campo","Encadenamiento de pasos del mismo usuario"],"correct":[1,4],"explanation":"Reducir clics y repeticiones agiliza el trabajo.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two design choices improve repetitive tasks? (Choose 2)","options":["Unneeded intermediate screens","Smart defaults","Asking the same data repeatedly","Confirmations on every field","Chaining the same user's steps"],"explanation":"Fewer clicks and repeats speed work."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué principio guía un modelo de datos seguro en Appian?","options":["Dar acceso completo y ocultar datos en las interfaces","Mínimo privilegio en datos y seguridad en el registro","Nada","Guardar todo en constantes"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"La seguridad debe aplicarse en la capa de datos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which principle guides a secure Appian data model?","options":["Full access while hiding data in interfaces","Least privilege on data and record-level security","Nothing","Storing everything in constants"],"explanation":"Security must be enforced at the data layer."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos técnicas protegen datos sensibles en un modelo de datos? (Elige 2)","options":["Seguridad de filas y de campos en registros","Exponerlos en Web APIs públicas sin autenticación","Duplicarlos en varias tablas sin control de acceso","Guardarlos en un campo de texto visible para todos los usuarios del sistema","Separar datos sensibles en tablas con acceso restringido"],"correct":[0,4],"explanation":"Seguridad granular y separación reducen exposición.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two techniques protect sensitive data in a data model? (Choose 2)","options":["Row and field security on records","Exposing it via public unauthenticated Web APIs","Duplicating it across tables without access control","Storing it in a text field visible to all system users","Separating sensitive data into restricted tables"],"explanation":"Granular security and separation reduce exposure."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué riesgo tiene usar consultas a entidades (a!queryEntity) para datos con seguridad de filas definida en el registro?","options":["Que la consulta aplica una seguridad aún más estricta que el registro","Saltarse la seguridad del registro","Ninguno","Más rendimiento"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"La seguridad de registros solo se aplica al consultar el registro.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's the risk of querying entities (a!queryEntity) for data with record row security?","options":["The query applies even stricter security than the record","Bypassing the record's security","None","More performance"],"explanation":"Record security applies only when querying the record."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué es Data Fabric desde la perspectiva de un lead?","options":["Un plug-in","Nada","Una capa virtual que unifica datos de varias fuentes en registros","Una herramienta para copiar todos los datos a la base de Appian"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Permite relacionar y consultar datos sin moverlos a un único sitio.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What is Data Fabric from a lead's perspective?","options":["A plug-in","Nothing","A virtual layer unifying multi-source data as records","A tool copying all data into Appian's DB"],"explanation":"It relates and queries data without centralizing it."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos decisiones toma un lead al diseñar con Data Fabric? (Elige 2)","options":["Qué fuentes sincronizar y cuáles consultar en tiempo real","Cómo relacionar registros de distintas fuentes","Cuántos iconos mostrar por cada tipo de registro","Qué color dar a ca