rificar que los usuarios han cambiado su contraseña","Recuentos de origen y destino","Comprobar que los colores de las interfaces no han cambiado","Comprobación de integridad referencial"],"correct":[2,4],"explanation":"Recuentos e integridad confirman la migración.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two validations should a data migration include? (Choose 2)","options":["Reviewing the app's icon count","Verifying users changed their passwords","Source vs target counts","Checking interface colors haven't changed","Referential integrity checks"],"explanation":"Counts and integrity confirm the migration."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Dónde conviene ejecutar la transformación de millones de filas en una migración?","options":["En la base de datos con scripts por lotes","En la interfaz","En el navegador","En un proceso Appian con un nodo por fila"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"La BD procesa volúmenes grandes mucho mejor.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Where should transforming millions of rows in a migration run?","options":["In the database with batch scripts","In the interface","In the browser","In an Appian process with one node per row"],"explanation":"The DB handles large volumes far better."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué patrón ayuda a una migración sin parada larga?","options":["Migración incremental con sincronización final","Nada","Migrar todo de una vez durante horas laborables","Parar el negocio una semana"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Las cargas incrementales reducen la ventana de corte.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which pattern helps migrate without a long outage?","options":["Incremental migration with a final sync","Nothing","Migrate everything at once during business hours","Stop the business for a week"],"explanation":"Incremental loads shrink the cutover window."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos características debe tener una base de datos de alto volumen para Appian? (Elige 2)","options":["Columnas de texto para todo tipo de dato","Tablas sin claves primarias para ganar velocidad","Consultas sin filtros para simplificar","Estrategia de archivado de datos históricos","Índices alineados con las consultas"],"correct":[3,4],"explanation":"Índices y archivado mantienen el rendimiento.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two traits should a high-volume database for Appian have? (Choose 2)","options":["Text columns for every data type","Keyless tables for speed","Unfiltered queries for simplicity","A historical data archiving strategy","Indexes aligned with queries"],"explanation":"Indexes and archiving maintain performance."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué técnica de base de datos ayuda con tablas de cientos de millones de filas?","options":["Particionado","Eliminar todos los índices para acelerar las escrituras","Duplicar la tabla","Nada"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"El particionado mejora consultas y mantenimiento.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which DB technique helps with tables of hundreds of millions of rows?","options":["Partitioning","Dropping all indexes to speed writes","Duplicating the table","Nothing"],"explanation":"Partitioning improves queries and maintenance."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué patrón separa la carga de reporting de la carga transaccional?","options":["Ejecutar todos los informes sobre las tablas transaccionales","Borrar datos","Nada","Vistas, tablas de resumen o réplicas para reporting"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Separar cargas evita contención.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which pattern separates reporting load from transactional load?","options":["Run every report on transactional tables","Delete data","Nothing","Views, summary tables or replicas for reporting"],"explanation":"Separating loads avoids contention."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué evalúa un lead antes de usar una vista de base de datos como fuente de un registro sincronizado?","options":["El color","Nada","Solo que la vista tenga un nombre descriptivo","Coste de 