ke the user wait for all integrations","Confirm to the user and process the rest in the background","Nothing"],"explanation":"Users needn't wait for what they don't need."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos riesgos tiene el activity chaining excesivo en procesos de alto volumen? (Elige 2)","options":["Experiencia lenta","Mejor escalabilidad","Menor consumo de memoria en los motores durante el encadenamiento","Recursos ocupados más tiempo","Más velocidad"],"correct":[0,3],"explanation":"Encadenar de más penaliza.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two risks does excessive activity chaining pose in high-volume processes? (Choose 2)","options":["Slow experience","Better scalability","Lower engine memory use during chaining","Resources held longer","More speed"],"explanation":"Over-chaining penalizes."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene cuando un registro sincronizado se acerca a su límite de filas?","options":["Esperar a que falle la sincronización para actuar","Planificar filtros, archivado o rediseño antes de llegar","Duplicar el registro","Nada"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Anticiparse evita interrupciones.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's advisable when a synced record nears its row limit?","options":["Wait for sync to fail before acting","Plan filters, archiving or redesign before hitting it","Duplicate the record","Nothing"],"explanation":"Anticipating avoids outages."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué patrón ayuda a escalar la búsqueda de casos?","options":["Mostrar todos los casos","Búsqueda de texto libre sobre todos los campos de todas las tablas","Nada","Filtros indexados y resultados paginados"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Búsquedas acotadas y paginadas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which pattern helps case search scale?","options":["Show all cases","Free-text search over every field of every table","Nothing","Indexed filters and paged results"],"explanation":"Bounded, paged searches."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","