uy visitadas?","options":["Mostrar menos datos sin criterio","Precalcular métricas periódicamente","Calcular las métricas en tiempo real en cada visita","Nada"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"El precálculo evita repetir trabajo.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which pattern reduces computation in heavily visited summary interfaces?","options":["Show less data arbitrarily","Precompute metrics periodically","Compute metrics live on every visit","Nothing"],"explanation":"Precomputing avoids repeated work."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene comunicar al negocio respecto a métricas precalculadas?","options":["Que siempre son en tiempo real aunque no lo sean","Que son estimaciones aleatorias","Su frecuencia de actualización","Nada"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"El negocio debe saber la frescura del dato.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What should be communicated to the business about precomputed metrics?","options":["That they're always real time even if not","That they're random estimates","Their refresh frequency","Nothing"],"explanation":"The business must know data freshness."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos acciones ayudan a detectar problemas de escalabilidad antes de producción? (Elige 2)","options":["Esperar a los primeros incidentes reales","Probar solo con el usuario del desarrollador","Revisión de diseño enfocada en volumen","Pruebas de carga con datos realistas","Probar con una base de datos vacía"],"correct":[2,3],"explanation":"Probar y revisar con volumen.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two actions help find scalability issues before production? (Choose 2)","options":["Waiting for the first real incidents","Testing only with the developer's user","Volume-focused design reviews","Load tests with realistic data","Testing with an empty database"],"explanation":"Test and review with volume."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene cuando una consulta necesaria es lenta y no puede optimizarse más en Appian?","options":["Ocultar la interfaz","Ejecutarla más veces para obtener resultados en caché del navegador","Nada","Optimizar en BD (índices, vistas) o cambiar el diseño"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"A veces la solución está en la capa de datos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's advisable when a needed query is slow and can't be optimized further in Appian?","options":["Hide the interface","Run it more often to get browser-cached results","Nothing","Optimize in the DB (indexes, views) or redesign"],"explanation":"Sometimes the fix is in the data layer."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué patrón ayuda a escalar procesos que esperan respuestas externas?","options":["Nada","Eventos de mensaje en lugar de sondeo","Tareas manuales","Bucles de comprobación cada pocos segundos dentro del proceso"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Los eventos no consumen recursos esperando.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which pattern helps scale processes awaiting external responses?","options":["Nothing","Message events instead of polling","Manual tasks","Check loops every few seconds inside the process"],"explanation":"Events consume nothing while waiting."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos riesgos tiene el sondeo (polling) frecuente de un sistema externo desde procesos? (Elige 2)","options":["Menor uso de memoria en los motores","Respuestas instantáneas sin coste alguno","Acumulación de nodos e instancias","Simplificación de la arquitectura de integración","Carga innecesaria en ambos sistemas"],"correct":[2,4],"explanation":"El sondeo es costoso.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two risks come from frequent polling of an external system from processes? (Choose 2)","options":["Lower engine memory","Instant, free responses","Accumulating nodes and instances","Simpler integration architecture","Needless load on both systems"],"explanation":"Polling is costly."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene para tareas asignadas a grupos muy grandes en términos de rendimiento?","options":["Asig