":"¿Qué ventaja tiene consultar campos de registros relacionados en una sola consulta?","options":["Ninguna","Que la consulta ignora la seguridad del registro relacionado","Más código","Evita consultas adicionales por cada fila"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Las relaciones permiten traer datos relacionados de una vez.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's the advantage of querying related record fields in one query?","options":["None","The query ignores the related record's security","More code","It avoids extra queries per row"],"explanation":"Relationships fetch related data in one go."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de datos de Appian representa una lista de valores?","options":["Un grupo","Un texto separado por comas, que es la única forma de listas","Un documento","Un array (lista) del tipo correspondiente"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Appian admite listas de cualquier tipo.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which Appian data type represents a list of values?","options":["A group","Comma-separated text, the only way to do lists","A document","An array (list) of the matching type"],"explanation":"Appian supports lists of any type."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué patrón evita la sobrecarga de una tabla de reporting muy consultada?","options":["Más interfaces","Recalcular todas las métricas desde las tablas de detalle en cada carga","Ninguno","Tablas o vistas de resumen precalculadas"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Precalcular resúmenes reduce el coste de lectura.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which pattern avoids overloading a heavily-read reporting table?","options":["More interfaces","Recomputing every metric from detail tables on each load","None","Precomputed summary tables or views"],"explanation":"Precomputing summaries cuts read cost."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué consideración hay al crear un CDT anidado (con otro CDT dentro) mapeado a base de datos?","options":["Define tablas relacionadas y su comportamiento de escritura en cascada","Ninguna","Que todo se guarda en una sola columna de texto serializada","Que no se puede consultar"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Los CDT anidados generan relaciones entre tablas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's a consideration when creating a nested CDT (a CDT inside another) mapped to a database?","options":["It defines related tables and cascading write behavior","None","Everything is stored in one serialized text column","It can't be queried"],"explanation":"Nested CDTs create table relationships."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos prácticas mejoran la mantenibilidad del modelo de datos? (Elige 2)","options":["Sin claves","Columnas genéricas como campo1, campo2","Documentar tablas y relaciones","Duplicar tablas por departamento","Convenciones de nombres consistentes"],"correct":[2,4],"explanation":"Nombres claros y documentación facilitan el mantenimiento.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two practices improve data model maintainability? (Choose 2)","options":["No keys","Generic columns like field1, field2","Documenting tables and relationships","Duplicating tables per department","Consistent naming conventions"],"explanation":"Clear names and documentation ease maintenance."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué consideración hay al almacenar datos personales sensibles?","options":["Restringir el acceso y cumplir la normativa aplicable","Ninguna","Guardarlos en constantes para que estén siempre disponibles","Mostrarlos en todos los informes"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Los datos sensibles requieren seguridad y cumplimiento.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's a consideration when storing sensitive personal data?","options":["Restricting access and complying with applicable regulations","None","Storing them in constants so they're always available","Showing them in every report"],"explanation":"Sensitive data needs security and compliance."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué indica una relación definida en el registro pero sin clave foránea en la base de datos?","options":["Nada","Appian puede relacionarlos, pero la BD no garantiza la integridad","Que la relación no funcionará nunca en Appian","Que hay un error de sincronización"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Las FK en BD añaden integridad referencial.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does a relationship defined in the record but with no foreign key in the database mean?","options":["Nothing","Appian can relate them, but the DB doesn't enforce integrity","The relationship will never work in Appian","A sync error"],"explanation":"DB foreign keys add referential integrity."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué es una migración de datos en una aplicación Appian?","options":["Mover o transformar datos al cambiar el modelo o el sistema","Un plug-in","Copiar la aplicación de desarrollo a producción mediante un paquete","Un tipo de interfaz"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Las migraciones requieren scripts y pruebas específicas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What is a data migration in an Appian app?","options":["Moving or transforming data when the model or system changes","A plug-in","Copying the app from dev to prod via a package","An interface type"],"explanation":"Migrations need specific scripts and testing."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos pasos son recomendables en una migración de datos? (Elige 2)","options":["Desactivar las claves para siempre","No documentarla","Validar recuentos y muestras tras migrar","Copia de seguridad previa","Hacerla directamente en producción sin ensayo"],"correct":[2,3],"explanation":"Backup y validación reducen el riesgo de pérdida de datos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two steps are recommended in a data migration? (Choose 2)","options":["Permanently disabling keys","Not documenting it","Validate counts and samples afterward","Prior backup","Running it straight in production untested"],"explanation":"Backup and validation reduce data-loss risk."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué 