cación.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's the limitation of using only CRM without Data Cloud for an agent?","options":["It can't escalate","It can't run flows","It can't read any record","No managed RAG or unified external data"],"explanation":"Data Cloud enables semantic search and unification."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos componentes participan en el anclaje con datos estructurados de Data Cloud? (Elige 2)","options":["Plantillas de correo Classic","Calculated insights","Data graphs","Diseños de página","Reglas de validación"],"correct":[1,2],"explanation":"Ambos aportan datos estructurados de perfiles.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two components ground with structured Data Cloud data? (Choose 2)","options":["Classic email templates","Calculated insights","Data graphs","Page layouts","Validation rules"],"explanation":"Both supply structured profile data."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de actualización tiene un índice basado en un data stream programado?","options":["Solo al activar el agente","Cada vez que se abre Setup","Nunca se actualiza tras crearse","Se actualiza tras cada ingesta"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"El índice procesa los cambios del DMO de origen.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"How does an index based on a scheduled data stream update?","options":["Only on agent activation","Whenever Setup opens","Never after creation","After each ingestion"],"explanation":"The index processes source DMO changes."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué recomienda Salesforce si dos documentos contradicen la misma política?","options":["Subir la temperatura","Indexar ambos con más peso","Corregir el contenido fuente","Dejar que el modelo elija"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"El contenido contradictorio produce respuestas inconsistentes.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does Salesforce recommend if two documents contradict the same policy?","options":["Raise temperature","Index both with more weight","Fix the source content","Let the model choose"],"explanation":"Contradictory content yields inconsistent answers."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué es la activación en Data Cloud?","options":["Activar la Trust Layer","Activar una versión de agente","Enviar segmentos o datos a sistemas de destino","Activar una plantilla"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"La activación publica audiencias a destinos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What is activation in Data Cloud?","options":["Enabling the Trust Layer","Activating an agent version","Sending segments or data to target systems","Activating a template"],"explanation":"Activation publishes audiences to destinations."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ventaja tiene usar Data Cloud para auditar conversaciones de agentes?","options":["Que cambia el modelo","Analizar y consultar los datos de auditoría","Que nadie puede verlos","Que se borran automáticamente"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Los datos pueden consultarse y usarse en informes.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's the benefit of using Data Cloud to audit agent conversations?","options":["It changes the model","Analyzing and querying audit data","Nobody can see them","They auto-delete"],"explanation":"Data can be queried and used in reports."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué consideración hay al indexar contenido con imágenes o tablas complejas?","options":["No se puede subir","Se indexa perfectamente siempre sin pérdida","Se convierte en vídeo","Puede necesitar preprocesado para extraer texto útil"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"El texto extraído determina lo recuperable.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's a consideration when indexing content with images or complex tables?","options":["It can't be uploaded","It always indexes perfectly with no loss","It becomes video","It may need preprocessing to extract useful text"],"explanation":"Extracted text determines what's retrievable."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dato de Data Cloud permite a un agente saber el último pedido online de un cliente?","options":["Un DMO de pedidos de la fuente de comercio","El perfil del usuario","El campo descripción de la cuenta en CRM","El historial de Chatter"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Los datos de comercio ingeridos y unificados.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which Data Cloud data tells an agent a customer's last online order?","options":["An order DMO from the commerce source","The user profile","The CRM account description","Chatter history"],"explanation":"Ingested, unified commerce data."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos riesgos reduce una buena gobernanza de datos para Agentforce? (Elige 2)","options":["Que el canal se cierre","Que el agente tenga demasiados colores","Que falten licencias de Chatter","Exposición de datos sensibles","Respuestas basadas en datos erróneos"],"correct":[3,4],"explanation":"Gobernanza = calidad y seguridad.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two risks does good data governance reduce for Agentforce? (Choose 2)","options":["Channel closing","Too many agent colors","Missing Chatter licenses","Sensitive data exposure","Answers based on bad data"],"explanation":"Governance = quality and security."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué permite el conector de Amazon S3 en Data Cloud para un agente?","options":["Ejecutar Apex en S3","Copiar usuarios","Ingerir archivos para indexarlos","Alojar el agente en AWS"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Archivos en S3 pueden alimentar UDMOs.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does the Amazon S3 connector allow for an agent?","options":["Running Apex in S3","Copying users","Ingesting files to index","Hosting the agent on AWS"],"explanation":"S3 files can feed UDMOs."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene configurar para que un retriever priorice contenido reciente?","options":["Una temperatura alta","Filtros o campos de fecha en la recuperación","Un tema nuevo","Una regla de validación"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Filtrar por vigencia evita información 