annerBundle, etc.).","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which Salesforce CLI command retrieves an agent's metadata from an org?","options":["sf org list","sf apex run","sf data export tree","sf project retrieve start"],"explanation":"Retrieve brings metadata (GenAiPlannerBundle, etc.)."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué comando despliega metadatos de agentes a una organización?","options":["sf project deploy start","sf data import tree","sf org create user","sf agent preview"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Deploy envía los metadatos al destino.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which command deploys agent metadata to an org?","options":["sf project deploy start","sf data import tree","sf org create user","sf agent preview"],"explanation":"Deploy sends metadata to the target."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué permite el comando sf agent preview?","options":["Borrar conversaciones","Conversar con un agente desde la línea de comandos","Desplegar el agente a producción sin pruebas","Cambiar el modelo"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Permite probar interactivamente un agente vía CLI.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does sf agent preview allow?","options":["Deleting conversations","Chatting with an agent from the command line","Deploying the agent to production without tests","Changing the model"],"explanation":"It lets you test an agent interactively via CLI."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué consideración tienen los canales de mensajería al desplegar?","options":["Se despliegan siempre activos con el agente sin pasos adicionales","No son necesarios en producción","Se crean solos","Deben configurarse y conectarse en destino"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Messaging channels, deployments y flujos de Omni-Channel requieren configuración.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What consideration do messaging channels have when deploying?","options":["They always deploy active with the agent, no extra steps","They're not needed in production","They self-create","They must be configured and connected in the target"],"explanation":"Messaging channels, deployments and Omni-Channel flows need setup."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de análisis de Testing Center ayuda a evaluar la respuesta además del tema y acción?","options":["Conteo de usuarios activos","Análisis de licencias","Medición del tamaño del archivo de pruebas","Evaluación de la respuesta frente a la esperada"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Testing Center evalúa respuestas con criterios (p. ej. LLM-as-judge).","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which Testing Center analysis evaluates the response besides topic and action?","options":["Counting active users","License analysis","Measuring test file size","Evaluating the response against the expected one"],"explanation":"Testing Center evaluates responses with criteria (e.g. LLM-as-judge)."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué recomienda Salesforce para el volumen de casos de prueba?","options":["Solo frases perfectas","Solo un caso por agente","No probar casos negativos","Cubrir casos frecuentes, límite y negativos"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Cobertura amplia incluye intentos fuera de ámbito.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does Salesforce recommend for test case volume?","options":["Only perfect utterances","One case per agent","Skip negative cases","Cover common, edge and negative cases"],"explanation":"Broad coverage includes off-scope attempts."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué indica una prueba fallida por tema incorrecto?","options":["Que la sandbox está caducada","Que el usuario del agente no tiene licencia","Que hay que subir la temperatura","Revisar descripciones de clasificación"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"La clasificación depende de las descripciones.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does a test failing on wrong topic indicate?","options":["The sandbox expired","The agent user has no license","Raise temperature","Review classification descriptions"],"explanation":"Classification depends on descriptions."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos permisos o elementos suelen olvidarse al desplegar un agente? (Elige 2)","options":["Acceso a clases Apex o flujos","Crear un año fiscal nuevo","Cambiar el logotipo de la organización","Cambiar el idioma corporativo","Asignar conjuntos de permisos al usuario del agente"],"correct":[0,4],"explanation":"Permisos de ejecución de acciones son críticos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two items are often forgotten when deploying an agent? (Choose 2)","options":["Apex class or flow access","Creating a new fiscal year","Changing the org logo","Changing the corporate language","Assigning permission sets to the agent user"],"explanation":"Action execution permissions are critical."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ventaja tiene DevOps Center para equipos que construyen agentes?","options":["Control de cambios con Git y pipelines","Que evita usar sandboxes","Que activa agentes sin probar","Que despliega sin metadatos"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"DevOps Center gestiona trabajo, ramas y promociones.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's DevOps Center's benefit for teams building agents?","options":["Change control with Git and pipelines","It avoids sandboxes","It activates agents untested","It deploys without metadata"],"explanation":"DevOps Center manages work items, branches and promotions."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué hay que revisar en las plantillas de prompt al pasar de sandbox a producción?","options":["Que se hayan borrado en sandbox","Que la versión correcta esté activa","Que no tengan descripción","Que tengan temperatura máxima"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Las versiones activas deben comprobarse en destino.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What must be checked in prompt templates moving from sandbox to production?","options":["That they were deleted in sandbox","That the right version is active","That they have no description","That they have max temperature"],"explanation":"Active versions must 