or","Pruebas negativas y de seguridad","Pruebas de carga del canal","Ninguna"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Probar intentos de acceso indebido e inyección.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which test verifies an agent doesn't reveal other customers' data?","options":["Color tests","Negative and security tests","Channel load tests","None"],"explanation":"Test improper access and injection attempts."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos aspectos conviene vigilar del consumo tras el despliegue? (Elige 2)","options":["Uso de créditos o conversaciones","Número de reglas de validación","Tamaño del logotipo","Color del tema","Picos por canal o tema"],"correct":[0,4],"explanation":"Controlar el consumo evita sorpresas de coste.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two consumption aspects should be watched after deployment? (Choose 2)","options":["Credit or conversation usage","Number of validation rules","Logo size","Topic color","Spikes by channel or topic"],"explanation":"Tracking consumption avoids cost surprises."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué indica el análisis de frases sin tema (unmatched utterances)?","options":["Necesidades no cubiertas por el agente","Que el canal está caído","Nada","Que el usuario no tiene permisos"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Ayuda a priorizar nuevos temas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What do unmatched utterances indicate?","options":["Needs the agent doesn't cover","The channel is down","Nothing","The user lacks permissions"],"explanation":"They help prioritize new topics."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene hacer con conversaciones reales problemáticas detectadas en producción?","options":["Publicarlas","Borrarlas","Añadirlas como casos de prueba","Ignorarlas"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Alimentan las pruebas de regresión.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What to do with problematic real conversations found in production?","options":["Publish them","Delete them","Add them as test cases","Ignore them"],"explanation":"They feed regression tests."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué recomienda Salesforce sobre quién puede modificar agentes en producción?","options":["Permitirlo al usuario del agente","Restringirlo a administradores autorizados","No hay recomendación","Permitirlo a todos los usuarios"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Control de cambios y permisos de gestión.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does Salesforce recommend on who can modify production agents?","options":["Allow the agent user","Restrict to authorized admins","No guidance","Allow all users"],"explanation":"Change control and management permissions."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué permite el registro de auditoría de configuración respecto a agentes?","options":["Restaurar versiones","Cambiar el modelo","Ver quién cambió la configuración","Ver las respuestas del modelo"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Setup Audit Trail registra cambios de configuración.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does configuration audit logging allow regarding agents?","options":["Restoring versions","Changing the model","Seeing who changed the configuration","Seeing model responses"],"explanation":"Setup Audit Trail logs configuration changes."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de acción en producción conviene limitar al principio de un lanzamiento?","options":["El tono","Acciones de solo lectura de Knowledge","Acciones que modifican datos críticos","El saludo"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Empezar con capacidades de bajo riesgo.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which actions should be limited early in a launch?","options":["The tone","Read-only Knowledge actions","Actions modifying critical data","The greeting"],"explanation":"Start with low-risk capabilities."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué fase del ciclo de vida define objetivos, casos de uso y métricas antes de construir?","options":["Retirada del agente y archivado de sus versiones","Planificación y diseño","Despliegue con change sets a la organización de destino","Supervisión en producción tras varios meses de uso del agente"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Se definen alcance, KPIs y riesgos antes de construir.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which lifecycle phase defines goals, use cases and metrics before building?","options":["Retiring the agent and archiving its versions","Planning and design","Deployment with change sets to the target org","Production monitoring after months of agent use"],"explanation":"Scope, KPIs and risks are defined before building."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos elementos conviene definir en la fase de diseño de un agente? (Elige 2)","options":["Métricas de éxito","El número de perfiles que tendrá la organización dentro de un año","Casos de uso y límites","El color exacto del botón de chat del sitio web","Los nombres de las variables internas del motor de razonamiento"],"correct":[0,2],"explanation":"Alcance claro y criterios de éxito medibles.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two items should be defined in an agent's design phase? (Choose 2)","options":["Success metrics","How many profiles the org will have in a year","Use cases and limits","The exact color of the site's chat button","Internal reasoning engine variable names"],"explanation":"Clear scope and measurable success criteria."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene hacer antes de construir acciones nuevas para un agente?","options":["Crear un perfil nuevo para cada acción prevista del agente","Borrar todos los flujos existentes para empezar de cero sin dependencias","Comprar licencias adicionales de Chatter para todos los usuarios","Inventariar flujos y Apex reutilizables"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Reutilizar lógica probada acelera y reduce riesgos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What should be done before building new actions for an agent?","options":["Create a new profile for each planned agent action","Delete all existing flows to start fresh without dependencies","Buy extra Chatter licenses for a