ar con frases generadas por IA en Testing Center?","options":["Que se activan solas","Que las pruebas no consumen nada","Que no hace falta revisar los resultados","Más variedad de formas de preguntar"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"La IA genera variaciones que enriquecen la cobertura.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's the benefit of testing with AI-generated utterances in Testing Center?","options":["They self-activate","Tests consume nothing","No need to review results","More variety in phrasing"],"explanation":"AI generates variations that enrich coverage."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué elemento debe revisarse si las pruebas pasan en sandbox pero fallan en producción?","options":["La versión del navegador","El idioma de Setup","El color del agente","Diferencias de datos, permisos o configuración"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Los entornos pueden diferir en datos y permisos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What must be checked if tests pass in sandbox but fail in production?","options":["Browser version","Setup language","Agent color","Data, permission or config differences"],"explanation":"Environments may differ in data and permissions."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué hay que considerar con las credenciales con nombre usadas por acciones al desplegar?","options":["Configurar los secretos en cada entorno","No hacen falta en producción","Se comparten con los clientes","Se despliegan siempre con la contraseña incluida"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Los secretos no viajan en metadatos; se configuran por entorno.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What must be considered with named credentials used by actions when deploying?","options":["Set the secrets in each environment","They're not needed in production","They're shared with customers","They always deploy with the password included"],"explanation":"Secrets don't travel in metadata; set per environment."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene incluir en la documentación de un agente para su 