uración respecto a Data 360?","options":["Saber quién cambió la configuración","Ver los datos de clientes que se borraron en los últimos 90 días","Activar segmentos","Cambiar el modelo"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Setup Audit Trail registra cambios.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does configuration audit logging allow for Data 360?","options":["Knowing who changed configuration","Seeing customer data deleted in the last 90 days","Activating segments","Changing the model"],"explanation":"Setup Audit Trail logs changes."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de herramientas de desarrollo permiten crear transformaciones o insights por código?","options":["APIs y SQL de Data 360","Fórmulas de CRM","Solo la interfaz de arrastrar y soltar","Chatter"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Hay APIs y SQL además de interfaces declarativas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which dev tools allow building transforms or insights in code?","options":["Data 360 APIs and SQL","CRM formulas","Only the drag-and-drop UI","Chatter"],"explanation":"APIs and SQL exist besides declarative UIs."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué consideración tiene asignar el permiso de Data 360 a muchos usuarios?","options":["No afecta al gobierno","Reduce el consumo","Más usuarios administradores siempre mejora la seguridad","Cada usuario debe tener solo lo necesario para su rol"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Mínimo privilegio.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's the consideration when assigning Data 360 permissions to many users?","options":["It doesn't affect governance","It reduces consumption","More admin users always improves security","Each user should have only what their role needs"],"explanation":"Least privilege."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos fuentes de información ayudan a diagnosticar un insight que no se calcula? (Elige 2)","options":["El nombre del administrador que creó la organización","El color asignado al insight en los paneles de CRM","La validación de la consult