afting personalized content for each audience"],"explanation":"Content generated with segment data."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos validaciones conviene hacer en el destino tras una activación? (Elige 2)","options":["Que se creó un usuario","Que se borró el segmento","Que los atributos llegaron correctos","Que llegó el número esperado de miembros","Que cambió el logotipo"],"correct":[2,3],"explanation":"Validar extremo a extremo.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two validations should be done at the target after activation? (Choose 2)","options":["A user was created","The segment was deleted","Attributes arrived correctly","The expected member count arrived","The logo changed"],"explanation":"Validate end to end."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué permite una data action con webhook?","options":["Crear segmentos","Borrar perfiles","Ingerir datos","Notificar a un sistema externo en tiempo casi real"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Integración por eventos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does a webhook data action allow?","options":["Creating segments","Deleting profiles","Ingesting data","Notifying an external system near real time"],"explanation":"Event-based integration."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué consideración de seguridad tiene un webhook de data action?","options":["Enviar el token de acceso en la URL del webhook para simplificar","Enviar contraseñas en la URL","Exponerlo sin autenticación","Firmar y proteger el endpoint"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Se usan claves/firmas para verificar.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What security consideration applies to a data action webhook?","options":["Sending the access token in the webhook URL for simplicity","Send passwords in the URL","Expose it unauthenticated","Sign and protect the endpoint"],"explanation":"Keys/signatures verify messages."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué indica el término \"orquestación\" con datos de Data 360?","options":["Borrar datos","Coordinar acciones en varios canales según el perfil","Programar la ingesta de todos los data streams a la misma hora","Ingerir archivos"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Journeys y flujos con datos unificados.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does orchestration with Data 360 data mean?","options":["Deleting data","Coordinating actions across channels by profile","Scheduling every data stream's ingestion at the same time","Ingesting files"],"explanation":"Journeys and flows with unified data."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué limita el uso de un segmento en un destino publicitario?","options":["El idioma configurado en la organización de Salesforce","Requisitos de coincidencia y tamaño mínimo de audiencia","El color","El idioma de Setup"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Las plataformas tienen mínimos y tasas de coincidencia.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What limits using a segment at an ad target?","options":["The language configured in the Salesforce org","Match requirements and minimum audience size","Color","Setup language"],"explanation":"Platforms have minimums and match rates."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de segmento conviene para pruebas A/B de campañas?","options":["Un segmento vacío","Usar el mismo segmento sin divisiones para las dos variantes","Dividir la audiencia en grupos aleatorios","Un único segmento sin divisiones"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Grupos de control y prueba.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which segment approach suits A/B campaign tests?","options":["An empty segment","Using the same undivided segment for both variants","Splitting the audience into random groups","One undivided segment"],"explanation":"Control and test groups."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene comprobar si un segmento incluye clientes que se dieron de baja?","options":["El idioma","El tamaño del logo","Los filtros de consentimiento y su actualización","El color del segmento"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Consentimiento actualizado.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What to check if a segment includes unsubscribed customers?","options":["Language","Logo size","Consent filters and their freshness","Segment color"],"explanation":"Up-to-date consent."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué permite el uso de Data 360 en Agentforce para actuar?","options":["Que agentes borren perfiles","Que se desactive la Trust Layer","Que agentes usen perfiles e insights para decidir acciones","Que los agentes modifiquen las reglas de identidad según la conversación"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Datos para IA accionable.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does using Data 360 in Agentforce allow for action?","options":["Agents deleting profiles","Disabling the Trust Layer","Agents using profiles and insights to decide actions","Agents changing identity rules based on the conversation"],"explanation":"Data for actionable AI."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué indica el término \"activación en tiempo real\"?","options":["Enviar una vez al mes","No enviar","Enviar la audiencia completa una vez al mes de forma programada","Enviar cambios de audiencia casi al instante al destino"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Requiere destinos y segmentos compatibles.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does real-time activation mean?","options":["Sending monthly","Not sending","Sending the full audience once a month on a schedule","Sending audience changes near-instantly to the target"],"explanation":"Needs compatible targets and segments."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos elementos se pueden usar como criterios en un segmento? (Elige 2)","options":["Atributos del perfil","Calculated Insights","Diseños de página","Contraseñas de clientes","Perfiles de usuario de CRM"],"correct":[0,1],"explanation":"Atributos, relacionados e insights.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two items can be segment criteria? (Choose 2)","options":["Profile attributes","Calculated Insights","Page layouts","Customer passwords","CRM user profiles"],"explanation":"Attributes, related data and insights."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ocurre si se publica un segmento sin destino de activación?","options":["Se envía a todos los destinos","Falla siempre","Se envía automáticamente a todos los destinos configurados","Se calcula la pertenencia pero no se envía a ningún sitio"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Puede usarse para análisis o en Data 360.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What happens if a segment publishes with no activation target?","options":["It's sent to all targets","It always fails","It's automatically sent to every configured target","Membership is computed but sent nowhere"],"explanation":"It can be used for analysis or within Data 360."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene para evitar saturar a clientes con mensajes de varios segmentos?","options":["Enviar todos los mensajes y dejar que el cliente elija","Duplicar segmentos","Enviar todos los mensajes siempre","Reglas de prioridad o segmentos en cascada"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Control de frecuencia y prioridad.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What helps avoid flooding customers with messages from several segments?","options":["Send every message and let the customer choose","Duplicate segments","Always send every message","Priority rules or waterfall segments"],"explanation":"Frequency and priority control."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué indica una activación \"incremental\" frente a \"completa\"?","options":["Envía siempre todos los miembros","Envía solo cambios de pertenencia","No envía nada","Borra el destino"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Eficiencia en destinos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does incremental vs full activation mean?","options":["Always sends all members","Sends only membership changes","Sends nothing","Clears the target"],"explanation":"Efficiency at targets."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de criterio usarías para \"clientes con LTV mayor que 1.000\"?","options":["Una regla de reconciliación","Filtro sobre la medida del Calculated Insight","Una exclusión por país","Filtro sobre el nombre"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Insights como atributos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which criterion fits \"customers with LTV over 1,000\"?","options":["A reconciliation rule","A filter on the Calculated Insight measure","A country exclusion","A filter on name"],"explanation":"Insights as attributes."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene antes de activar a un destino nuevo por primera vez?","options":["Borrar los segmentos","Probar con un segmento pequeño","Activar la audiencia completa sin pruebas","Nada"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Pruebas controladas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's advisable before activating to a new target the first time?","options":["Delete segments","Test with a small segment","Activate the full audience untested","Nothing"],"explanation":"Controlled testing."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué permite el campo de motivo o fuente de pertenencia en un segmento?","options":["Cambiar el destino de activación según la región del cliente","Entender por qué un perfil está en la audiencia","Cambiar el modelo","Ingerir"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Trazabilidad de segmentación.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does a membership reason/source field allow?","options":["Changing the activation target by customer region","Understanding why a profile is in the audience","Changing the model","Ingesting"],"explanation":"Segmentation traceability."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos acciones son típicas tras detectar abandono de carrito? (Elige 2)","options":["Enviar un recordatorio por email","Cambiar el OWD","Mostrar una oferta personalizada en la web","Borrar el perfil del cliente","Desactivar el Web SDK"],"correct":[0,2],"explanation":"Recuperación de carrito.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two actions are typical after detecting cart abandonment? (Choose 2)","options":["Send a reminder email","Change OWD","Show a personalized web offer","Delete the customer profile","Disable the Web SDK"],"explanation":"Cart recovery."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué consideración hay con los husos horarios al programar activaciones?","options":["Ajustar envíos a la zona del cliente","Usar solo UTC sin revisar","Ignorarlos siempre","Usar siempre la zona horaria de la organización para todos los envíos"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Mejor experiencia.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's the time zone consideration when scheduling activations?","options":["Align sends to the customer's zone","Use only UTC unreviewed","Always ignore them","Always use the org time zone for every send"],"explanation":"Better experience."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué indica un segmento con población mayor que el número de perfiles unificados?","options":["Más clientes de los existentes","Que hay más clientes reales de los que Data 360 ha unificado","Un error de construcción o de entidad de segmentación","Que todo es correcto"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Revisar Segment On y criterios.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does a segment larger than the unified profile count indicate?","options":["More customers than exist","There are more real customers than Data 360 unified","A build or segment-entity error","All is fine"],"explanation":"Review Segment On and criteria."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ventaja tiene activar a Data 360 para usar en Agentforce?","options":["Que cambie el modelo","Que se borren segmentos","Que el agente puede publicar segmentos nuevos sin revisión","Que los agentes conozcan la audiencia del cliente"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Contexto para IA.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's the advantage of activating to Data 360 for Agentforce use?","options":["The model changes","Segments are deleted","The agent can publish new segments without review","Agents know the customer's audiences"],"explanation":"Context for AI."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de métrica mide el éxito de una activación de marketing?","options":["Tamaño del logotipo","Conversión de la audiencia activada","Número de usuarios","Número de data streams"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"KPIs de campaña.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which metric measures a marketing activation's success?","options":["Logo size","Conversion of the activated audience","Number of users","Number of data streams"],"explanation":"Campaign KPIs."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene si la tasa de coincidencia en una plataforma publicitaria es baja?","options":["Enviar más identificadores válidos con consentimiento","Enviar datos sin consentimiento","Reducir la audiencia a cero","Enviar datos sin consentimiento para aumentar la coincidencia"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Mejores identificadores mejoran el match.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What if the ad platform match rate is low?","options":["Send more valid consented identifiers","Send unconsented data","Shrink the audience to zero","Sending unconsented data to raise the match rate"],"explanation":"Better identifiers improve match."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos herramientas permiten actuar desde Data 360 dentro de Salesforce? (Elige 2)","options":["Agentforce","El Import Wizard","Schema Builder","Flow","Data Loader"],"correct":[0,3],"explanation":"Automatización e IA.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two tools let you act from Data 360 inside Salesforce? (Choose 2)","options":["Agentforce","Import Wizard","Schema Builder","Flow","Data Loader"],"explanation":"Automation and AI."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué indica el término \"journey\" en Marketing Cloud con datos de Data 360?","options":["Un viaje de empresa","Un data stream","Un data stream que recorre varias fuentes de origen","Un recorrido de mensajes basado en la audiencia"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Journey Builder usa audiencias activadas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does a Marketing Cloud journey with Data 360 data mean?","options":["A company trip","A data stream","A data stream crossing several source systems","A message path based on the audience"],"explanation":"Journey Builder uses activated audiences."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene revisar si un flujo desencadenado por Data Cloud no se ejecuta?","options":["El color del flujo y la carpeta donde está guardado","El idioma","El color del flujo","La condición de disparo y el objeto vigilado"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Configuración del trigger.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What to check if a Data Cloud-triggered flow doesn't run?","options":["The flow's color and the folder it's saved in","Language","Flow color","The trigger condition and watched object"],"explanation":"Trigger configuration."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué permite filtrar la activación por puntos de contacto válidos?","options":["Borrar los no válidos","Borrar los perfiles sin email del modelo de datos","Enviar a todos","Enviar solo a perfiles contactables"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Calidad de envío.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does filtering activation by valid contact points allow?","options":["Deleting invalid ones","Deleting profiles with no email from the data model","Sending to all","Sending only to reachable profiles"],"explanation":"Delivery quality."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de segmento conviene para un programa de fidelización por niveles?","options":["Un único segmento con todos los socios sin distinguir niveles","Segmentos aleatorios","Un único segmento sin criterios","Segmentos por nivel basados en insights de puntos"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Tiers por métricas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which segment approach suits a tiered loyalty program?","options":["A single segment with every member, no tier distinction","Random segments","One segment with no criteria","Tier segments based on points insights"],"explanation":"Tiers by metrics."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos riesgos tiene activar segmentos sin revisar consentimiento? (Elige 2)","options":["Más confianza","Incumplimiento normativo","Menor coste","Mejor entregabilidad","Daño de reputación"],"correct":[1,4],"explanation":"Privacidad.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two risks come from activating without checking consent? (Choose 2)","options":["More trust","Regulatory non-compliance","Lower cost","Better deliverability","Reputational damage"],"explanation":"Privacy."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué indica el estado \"Publishing\" en un segmento?","options":["Se está calculando y enviando la audiencia","Ya terminó con éxito","Que el segmento terminó y está listo para borrarse","Está borrado"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Estado intermedio.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does a segment's Publishing status mean?","options":["The audience is being computed and sent","It finished successfully","The segment finished and is ready to delete","It's deleted"],"explanation":"Intermediate status."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene si un segmento tarda demasiado en publicarse?","options":["Añadir más contenedores","Publicarlo cada minuto","Simplificar criterios o usar insights precalculados","Añadir más contenedores para repartir el cálculo"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Optimización.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What if a segment takes too long to publish?","options":["Add more containers","Publish every minute","Simplify criteria or use precomputed insights","Adding more containers to spread the calculation"],"explanation":"Optimization."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué indica el uso de Data 360 para servicio proactivo?","options":["Esperar a que el cliente abra un caso para revisar sus datos","Borrar casos","Detectar problemas y contactar antes de que el cliente llame","Esperar siempre a que llame el cliente"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Datos de uso o IoT disparan acciones.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does using Data 360 for proactive service mean?","options":["Waiting for the customer to open a case to review their data","Deleting cases","Detecting issues and reaching out before the customer calls","Always waiting for the call"],"explanation":"Usage or IoT data trigger actions."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de dato de IoT puede activar una acción en Data 360?","options":["Un permiso","Un diseño de página","Una lectura de sensor que supera un umbral","Una plantilla"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Streaming + insights + data actions.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which IoT data can trigger an action in Data 360?","options":["A permission","A page layout","A sensor reading crossing a threshold","A template"],"explanation":"Streaming + insights + data actions."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos características tiene un buen segmento? (Elige 2)","options":["Tamaño adecuado para el canal","Criterios contradictorios","Sin revisión","Sin propietario","Criterios claros ligados a un objetivo"],"correct":[0,4],"explanation":"Accionable y medible.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two traits does a good segment have? (Choose 2)","options":["Right size for the channel","Contradictory criteria","No review","No owner","Clear criteria tied to a goal"],"explanation":"Actionable and measurable."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué permite la activación a CRM mediante enriquecimientos frente a a Marketing Cloud?","options":["Enviar emails masivos","Enviar campañas masivas de email desde los registros de CRM","Que equipos de ventas y servicio vean el dato en sus registros","Publicar anuncios"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Uso interno en CRM.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does CRM enrichment allow vs Marketing Cloud activation?","options":["Mass emails","Sending mass email campaigns from CRM records","Sales and service see the data on their records","Publishing ads"],"explanation":"Internal CRM use."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene medir tras actuar sobre datos de Data 360 en servicio?","options":["Número de colores","El número de data streams creados durante el proyecto","Tamaño de archivos","Reducción de casos o mejora de satisfacción"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Impacto de negocio.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What should be measured after acting on Data 360 data in service?","options":["Number of colors","The number of data streams created during the project","File sizes","Fewer cases or better satisfaction"],"explanation":"Business impact."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ocurre con las activaciones si se desactiva el segmento?","options":["Siguen enviándose siempre","Dejan de actualizarse en el destino","Se duplican","Siguen enviándose con la última pertenencia calculada"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Dependencia segmento-activación.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What happens to activations if the segment is deactivated?","options":["They keep sending forever","They stop updating at the target","They duplicate","They keep sending with the last computed membership"],"explanation":"Segment-activation dependency."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de criterio de segmento usa la geografía del cliente?","options":["Un data stream","Una regla de identidad","Una regla de identidad que agrupa por ciudad","Atributo de dirección o región del perfil"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Atributos de perfil.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which segment criterion uses customer geography?","options":["A data stream","An identity rule","An identity rule grouping by city","A profile address or region attribute"],"explanation":"Profile attributes."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"Una aerolínea quiere ofrecer mejora de asiento solo a viajeros frecuentes con vuelo en las próximas 48 horas. ¿Qué combinación de criterios usa?","options":["Una regla de reconciliación por la fecha de vuelo más reciente","Un atributo de nombre del viajero con coincidencia difusa","Un filtro de consentimiento sin ninguna otra condición","Insight de nivel de viajero y condición relativa sobre la fecha de vuelo"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Se combinan métricas e eventos futuros relativos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"An airline wants to offer seat upgrades only to frequent flyers with a flight in the next 48 hours. Which criteria combination?","options":["A most-recent flight date reconciliation rule","A fuzzy-matched traveler name attribute","A consent filter with no other condition","Flyer tier insight plus a relative condition on flight date"],"explanation":"Metrics are combined with relative future events."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene hacer si el destino de activación exige el email en minúsculas y con hash?","options":["Excluir el email de la activación","Ajustar la activación o una fórmula para entregar el formato requerido","Crear un DMO personalizado por destino","Enviar el email tal cual y esperar que el destino lo transforme"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Algunos destinos publicitarios requieren identificadores normalizados y con hash.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What to do if the activation target requires lowercased, hashed email?","options":["Exclude email from the activation","Adjust the activation or a formula to deliver the required format","Create a custom DMO per target","Send the email as-is and hope the target transforms it"],"explanation":"Some ad targets need normalized, hashed identifiers."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"Marketing quiere saber cuántos clientes entraron en un segmento cada semana. ¿Qué dato usa?","options":["El historial de pertenencia al segmento","El número de data streams activos","Las reglas de identidad","El Setup Audit Trail de la organización"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"La membresía histórica permite analizar entradas y salidas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Marketing wants to know how many customers entered a segment each week. Which data?","options":["Segment membership history","Active data stream count","Identity rules","The org's Setup Audit Trail"],"explanation":"Historical membership allows entry/exit analysis."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos condiciones definen correctamente \"clientes que abrieron un email pero no compraron en 30 días\"? (Elige 2)","options":["Condición sobre engagement de email abierto en el periodo","Un atributo directo con el color favorito","Una regla de reconciliación por frecuencia","Un filtro de espacio de datos por marca","Exclusión de pedidos en los últimos 30 días"],"correct":[0,4],"explanation":"Inclusión por evento y exclusión por ausencia de compra.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two conditions correctly define \"customers who opened an email but didn't buy in 30 days\"? (Choose 2)","options":["A condition on email-opened engagement in the period","A direct favorite-color attribute","A most-frequent reconciliation rule","A brand data space filter","An exclusion of orders in the last 30 days"],"explanation":"Inclusion by event and exclusion by absence of purchase."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"Un agente de ventas autónomo debe contactar leads que visitaron precios tres veces esta semana. ¿Qué pieza de Data 360 lo dispara?","options":["Un insight o segmento sobre visitas con una acción que invoque al agente","Una regla de validación en el lead","Un informe de CRM revisado manualmente cada lunes","Una lista de selección global"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Los datos de comportamiento alimentan la acción del agente.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"An autonomous sales agent must contact leads who viewed pricing three times this week. Which Data 360 piece triggers it?","options":["An insight or segment on visits with an action invoking the agent","A validation rule on lead","A CRM report reviewed by hand every Monday","A global picklist"],"explanation":"Behavioral data feeds the agent's action."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué indica que una activación envíe menos miembros que el tamaño del segmento?","options":["Filtros de consentimiento o falta de punto de contacto válido","Un error que borra miembros del segmento al azar","Que el segmento está en otro idioma","Que la activación duplica a los clientes"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"No todos los miembros son contactables o han consentido.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does an activation sending fewer members than the segment size indicate?","options":["Consent filters or no valid contact point","An error randomly deleting segment members","The segment is in another language","The activation duplicates customers"],"explanation":"Not all members are reachable or consented."}}}]}$exam$::jsonb);

