atch"],"explanation":"Persistence enables resuming."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene en un lote para tratar los registros que fallaron?","options":["Un Logger en On Complete solamente","Ignorarlos","Un step con accept policy ONLY_FAILURES","Un step sin política"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Permite reportar o reintentar fallidos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's advisable in a batch to handle failed records?","options":["Only a Logger in On Complete","Ignore them","A step with ONLY_FAILURES accept policy","A step with no policy"],"explanation":"It allows reporting or retrying failures."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué indica el modo streaming del Batch Aggregator?","options":["Agrega en memoria sin límite","Procesa un único registro","Procesa todos los registros del step como un stream sin tamaño fijo","Desactiva la agregación y procesa cada registro por separado"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Útil para escribir archivos grandes.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does Batch Aggregator streaming mode do?","options":["Aggregates in memory without limit","Processes a single record","Processes all the step's records as a stream with no fixed size","Disables aggregation and processes each record separately"],"explanation":"Useful for writing large files."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué estructura de datos devuelve Parallel For Each si una ruta falla?","options":["Un payload vacío","El payload original","Un error compuesto con los resultados y fallos","Solo los resultados exitosos sin error"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"MULE:COMPOSITE_ROUTING.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does Parallel For Each return if a route fails?","options":["An empty payload","The original payload","A composite error with results and failures","Only successful results with no error"],"explanation":"MULE:COMPOSITE_ROUTING."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué se puede configurar en Parallel For Each para limitar hilos?","options":["batchSize"