os de objeto, FLS, horas e IP de login, entre otros.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two security settings are controlled from the profile? (Choose 2)","options":["Account OWD","Object permissions (create, read, edit, delete)","Fiscal year","Criteria-based sharing rules","Login hours and IPs"],"explanation":"The profile includes object permissions, FLS, login hours and IPs, among others."}}},{"domain":"D1","source":"bank","stem":"¿Cuándo conviene crear un perfil personalizado en lugar de usar conjuntos de permisos?","options":["Cuando un grupo de usuarios necesita una base distinta (p. ej. horas o IP de acceso)","Nunca","Siempre que un usuario necesite un permiso adicional puntual","Para cada usuario"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Salesforce recomienda perfiles mínimos y añadir permisos con permission sets; el perfil cubre ajustes base.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"When should you create a custom profile rather than use permission sets?","options":["When a user group needs a different baseline (e.g. login hours or IPs)","Never","Whenever a user needs one extra ad-hoc permission","For each user"],"explanation":"Salesforce recommends minimal profiles plus permission sets; the profile covers baseline settings."}}},{"domain":"D1","source":"bank","stem":"Un administrador cambia el OWD de cuentas de Público de lectura/escritura a Privado. ¿Qué efecto inmediato tiene?","options":["Ninguno hasta que cada usuario cierre sesión y vuelva a entrar al día siguiente","Se borran las cuentas ajenas","Se cambia el propietario de todas las cuentas","Los usuarios pierden acceso a cuentas que no poseen salvo por roles o colaboración"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"El OWD fija la base; el acceso se recalcula según roles, reglas y equipos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"An admin changes Account OWD from Public Read/Write to Private. What's the immediate effect?","options":["None until each user logs out and back in the next day","Others' accounts are deleted","All account owners change","Users lose access to accounts they don't own unless via roles or sharing"],"explanation":"OWD sets the baseline; access is recalculated from roles, rules and teams."}}},{"domain":"D1","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué representa la jerarquía de roles?","options":["Quién ve los datos de quién según la organización","El organigrama de permisos de objeto que puede tener cada usuario","Las licencias","Los perfiles"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Los roles definen acceso a datos hacia arriba; los permisos están en perfiles y conjuntos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does the role hierarchy represent?","options":["Who sees whose data across the organization","The chart of object permissions each user may have","Licenses","Profiles"],"explanation":"Roles define upward data access; permissions live in profiles and sets."}}},{"domain":"D1","source":"bank","stem":"Un nuevo jefe de ventas no ve las oportunidades de sus comerciales. Tiene el perfil correcto. ¿Qué falta probablemente?","options":["Crear una cola","Darle el perfil de administrador del sistema","Asignarle el rol correcto por encima de su equipo","Cambiar el OWD a público"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Sin el rol adecuado no hereda acceso de sus subordinados.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A new sales manager can't see their reps' opportunities. They have the right profile. What's likely missing?","options":["Creating a queue","Giving them the System Administrator profile","Assigning the right role above their team","Changing OWD to public"],"explanation":"Without the right role they don't inherit subordinates' access."}}},{"domain":"D1","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos acciones son buenas prácticas de seguridad para administradores? (Elige 2)","options":["Compartir la cuenta de administrador entre varias personas","Dar View All Data a todos los perfiles","Asignar permisos mínimos con conjuntos de permisos","Revisar periódicamente Setup Audit Trail","Desactivar MFA para agilizar el acceso"],"correct":[2,3],"explanation":"Mínimo privilegio y auditoría periódica.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two actions are admin security best practices? (Choose 2)","options":["Share the admin account among several people","Give View All Data to every profile","Grant minimal permissions with permission sets","Regularly review Setup Audit Trail","Disable MFA to speed up access"],"explanation":"Least privilege and periodic auditing."}}},{"domain":"D1","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ocurre con los registros de un usuario cuando se desactiva?","options":["Se borran automáticamente junto con su historial de actividad","Se archivan fuera de Salesforce","Pasan al administrador","Siguen existiendo y conservan el propietario"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Los registros permanecen; conviene transferirlos si alguien debe gestionarlos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What happens to a user's records when they're deactivated?","options":["They're auto-deleted with their activity history","They're archived outside Salesforce","They move to the admin","They remain and keep their owner"],"explanation":"Records remain; transfer them if someone must manage them."}}},{"domain":"D1","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué herramienta permite transferir muchos registros de un usuario a otro?","options":["Mass Transfer Records o Data Loader","Una regla de validación","Cambiar el perfil del usuario original al del nuevo propietario","Una vista de lista compartida"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"La transferencia masiva cambia el propietario de muchos registros.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which tool transfers many records from one user to another?","options":["Mass Transfer Records or Data Loader","A validation rule","Changing the original user's profile to the new owner's","A shared list view"],"explanation":"Mass transfer changes the owner of many records."}}},{"domain":"D1","source":"bank","stem":"Un administrador necesita que el idioma predeterminado de los nuevos usuarios sea español. ¿Dónde lo configura?","options":["En Company Information","En cada aplicación Lightning","