pire and can't be configured","Password policies configurable at org or profile level","Only for admins","Only by role"],"explanation":"Password Policies set expiration, complexity, history and attempts."}}},{"domain":"D1","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos herramientas sirven para encontrar quién tiene acceso a un registro concreto y por qué? (Elige 2)","options":["El botón Sharing Hierarchy / Compartir del registro","El historial de campos de oportunidad","El Setup Audit Trail de los últimos 180 días","La herramienta de acceso del registro (View Record Access)","El diseño de página"],"correct":[0,3],"explanation":"Desde el registro se ve quién tiene acceso y el motivo.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two tools show who has access to a specific record and why? (Choose 2)","options":["The record's Sharing Hierarchy / Sharing button","Opportunity field history","Setup Audit Trail for the last 180 days","The View Record Access tool","Page layout"],"explanation":"From the record you can see who has access and the reason."}}},{"domain":"D1","source":"bank","stem":"Un administrador quiere que cierta información de la página de inicio sea distinta para comerciales y soporte. ¿Qué hace?","options":["Cambiar el OWD","Crear dos organizaciones de Salesforce separadas para cada departamento","Asignar páginas de inicio Lightning distintas por perfil","Crear dos roles"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Las Home pages se activan por app y perfil.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"An admin wants Home page info to differ for sales and support. What do they do?","options":["Change the OWD","Create two separate Salesforce orgs per department","Assign different Lightning Home pages by profile","Create two roles"],"explanation":"Home pages are activated by app and profile."}}},{"domain":"D1","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué herramienta permite añadir el logotipo y los colores de la empresa a Lightning Experience?","options":["El perfil","Temas y marca (Themes and Branding)","Company Information","El diseño de