urce":"bank","stem":"Un comercial no ve un valor nuevo de la lista de selección Sector en su registro de cuenta. ¿Qué se revisa?","options":["Que el valor esté activo en el tipo de registro que usa","Su rol","Que tenga el permiso Modify All Data en su perfil","Su zona horaria"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Los valores de lista de selección se habilitan por tipo de registro.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A rep doesn't see a new Industry picklist value on their account. What's checked?","options":["That the value is enabled for the record type they use","Their role","That their profile has Modify All Data","Their time zone"],"explanation":"Picklist values are enabled per record type."}}},{"domain":"D1","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué recomienda Salesforce para dar acceso a datos a usuarios externos (clientes o partners) en Experience Cloud?","options":["Compartir usuarios internos","OWD externo y grupos de colaboración específicos","Darles el mismo perfil que a los empleados internos","Usar la jerarquía de roles interna"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Los OWD externos permiten un modelo más restrictivo para usuarios externos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does Salesforce recommend for giving external users (customers or partners) data access in Experience Cloud?","options":["Share internal users","External OWD and dedicated sharing groups","Give them the same profile as internal employees","Use the internal role hierarchy"],"explanation":"External OWDs allow a more restrictive model for external users."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"Un objeto Factura debe borrarse si se borra la cuenta y heredar su colaboración. ¿Qué relación se usa?","options":["Búsqueda con el campo obligatorio y la opción de borrar en cascada desactivada","Jerárquica","Externa","Principal-detalle"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Master-detail: borrado en cascada, colaboración heredada y propiedad del principal.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"An Invoice object must be deleted with its account and inherit its sharing. Which relationship is used?","options":["Lookup with the field required and cascade delete off","Hierarchical","External","Master-detail"],"explanation":"Master-detail: cascade delete, inherited sharing and master ownership."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué permite una relación principal-detalle que no permite una de búsqueda estándar?","options":["Mostrar listas relacionadas","Filtros de búsqueda","Relacionar registros de objetos distintos en la interfaz","Campos de resumen acumulativo (roll-up summary) en el principal"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Roll-up summary (COUNT, SUM, MIN, MAX) requiere master-detail.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does a master-detail relationship allow that a standard lookup doesn't?","options":["Showing related lists","Lookup filters","Relating records of different objects in the UI","Roll-up summary fields on the master"],"explanation":"Roll-up summary (COUNT, SUM, MIN, MAX) requires master-detail."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"Estudiantes y Cursos tienen una relación muchos a muchos. ¿Cómo se modela?","options":["Una lista de selección múltiple","Un objeto de unión con dos relaciones principal-detalle","Un campo de texto","Dos campos de búsqueda en Estudiante que apunten a Curso, uno por cada matrícula"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"El objeto de unión (junction) con dos master-detail modela muchos a muchos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Students and Courses have a many-to-many relationship. How is it modeled?","options":["A multi-select picklist","A junction object with two master-detail relationships","A text field","Two lookup fields on Student pointing to Course, one per enrollment"],"explanation":"A junction object with two master-detail relationships models many-to-many."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ocurre con los registros relacionados al borrar un registro principal en una relación de búsqueda opcional?","options":["Los hijos se borran siempre en cascada, igual que en principal-detalle","El campo de búsqueda de los hijos queda vacío por defecto","Se bloquea el borrado siempre","Los hijos cambian de propietario"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"En lookup opcional, por defecto se limpia el valor; también puede impedirse el borrado.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What happens to related records when a parent is deleted in an optional lookup relationship?","options":["Children are always cascade-deleted, like master-detail","The children's lookup field is cleared by default","Deletion is always blocked","Children change owner"],"explanation":"In an optional lookup, by default the value is cleared; deletion can also be prevented."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué requisito hay para convertir una relación de búsqueda en principal-detalle?","options":["Que el objeto hijo no tenga ningún campo personalizado creado","Que el objeto principal sea estándar","Ninguno","Todos los registros hijos deben tener valor en el campo de búsqueda"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"No puede haber hijos sin padre al convertir a master-detail.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's required to convert a lookup to master-detail?","options":["The child object must have no custom fields","The master object must be standard","None","Every child record must have a lookup value"],"explanation":"There can't be orphan children when converting to master-detail."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Cuántas relaciones principal-detalle puede tener un objeto personalizado?","options":["Una","Ilimitadas","Hasta cuarenta, igual que las relaciones de búsqueda","Hasta dos"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Un objeto puede tener como máximo dos relaciones master-detail.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"How many master-detail relationships can a custom object have?","options":["One","Unlimited","Up to forty, like lookup relationships","Up to two"],"explanation":"An object can have at most two master-detail relationships."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué relación especial solo existe en el objeto Usuario?","options":["De unión","Principal-detalle con objetos estándar como Cuenta y Contacto","Jerárquica","Externa"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"La relación jerárquica permite que un usuario apunte a otro (p. ej. gerente).","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which special relationship exists only on the User object?","options":["Junction","Master-detail with standard objects like Account and Contact","Hierarchical","External"],"explanation":"The hierarchical relationship lets a user point to another (e.g. manager)."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"Ventas y soporte usan el objeto Caso con procesos y valores distintos. ¿Qué se configura?","options":["Reglas de validación","Tipos de registro con diseños de página distintos","Dos perfiles sin cambios","Dos objetos personalizados diferentes, uno por departamento, con los mismos campos"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Los record types diferencian procesos, valores de lista y diseños por perfil.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Sales and support use Case with different processes and values. What's configured?","options":["Validation rules","Record types with different page layouts","Two unchanged profiles","Two different custom objects, one per department, with the same fields"],"explanation":"Record types differentiate processes, picklist values and layouts by profile."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué herramienta muestra gráficamente los objetos, campos y relaciones de la organización?","options":["Report Builder","Lightning App Builder","Schema Builder","Object Manager en vista de lista con todos los campos exportados"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Schema Builder visualiza y permite crear objetos y relaciones.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which tool shows the org's objects, fields and relationships graphically?","options":["Report Builder","Lightning App Builder","Schema Builder","Object Manager list view with all fields exported"],"explanation":"Schema Builder visualizes and lets you create objects and relationships."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"Un campo debe mostrar los días transcurridos desde la fecha de creación. ¿Qué tipo de campo se usa?","options":["Texto","Fórmula","Número que se actualiza a mano cada día por cada usuario","Roll-up summary"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Un campo fórmula como TODAY() - DATEVALUE(CreatedDate) se calcula al mostrarse.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A field must show days elapsed since creation. Which field type is used?","options":["Text","Formula","Number updated by hand daily by each user","Roll-up summary"],"explanation":"A formula like TODAY() - DATEVALUE(CreatedDate) calculates on display."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de campo permite mostrar en la oportunidad un valor de la cuenta relacionada sin copiarlo?","options":["Roll-up summary en la oportunidad que suma los campos de la cuenta","Fórmula entre objetos (cross-object formula)","Lista de selección dependiente","Búsqueda"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Las fórmulas pueden referenciar campos de objetos padre.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which field type shows a related account's value on the opportunity without copying it?","options":["Roll-up summary on the opportunity summing account fields","Cross-object formula","Dependent picklist","Lookup"],"explanation":"Formulas can reference parent object fields."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"Los valores de Subsector deben cambiar según el Sector elegido. ¿Qué se configura?","options":["Una regla de validación por cada combinación posible de sector y subsector","Lista de selección dependiente con Sector como campo controlador","Un flujo","Un tipo de registro por sector"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Las dependencias de campo filtran valores según un campo controlador.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Sub-industry values must change based on the Industry chosen. What's configured?","options":["A validation rule for each possible industry/sub-industry combo","Dependent picklist with Industry as controlling field","A flow","A record type per industry"],"explanation":"Field dependencies filter values based on a controlling field."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos tipos de campo pueden ser campo controlador de una lista dependiente? (Elige 2)","options":["Lista de selección","Casilla de verificación","Campo de texto largo","Campo de fórmula","Lista de selección múltiple"],"correct":[0,1],"explanation":"Controladores: picklist estándar/personalizada o checkbox; la multiselección solo puede ser dependiente.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two field types can be the controlling field of a dependent picklist? (Choose 2)","options":["Picklist","Checkbox","Long text area","Formula field","Multi-select picklist"],"explanation":"Controllers: standard/custom picklist or checkbox; multi-select can only be dependent."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"Varios objetos usan la misma lista de valores de Región. ¿Qué evita mantenerla en cada campo?","options":["Un conjunto de valores global (global value set)","Un objeto personalizado","Copiar la lista a mano en cada campo y revisarla una vez al año","Un campo de texto"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Los global value sets comparten valores entre campos de lista de selección.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Several objects use the same Region values. What avoids maintaining them per field?","options":["A global value set","A custom object","Copying the list by hand into each field and reviewing yearly","A text field"],"explanation":"Global value sets share values across picklist fields."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ocurre al borrar un campo personalizado?","options":["No se puede borrar nunca","Pasa a la papelera de reciclaje del usuario","Se elimina para siempre de inmediato sin posibilidad de recuperarlo, junto con sus datos","Se conserva 15 días en campos borrados y se puede restaurar"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Los campos borrados se pueden recuperar durante 15 días (sin algunos metadatos).","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What happens when a custom field is deleted?","options":["It can never be deleted","It goes to the user's recycle bin","It's permanently removed at once with its data, no recovery","It's kept 15 days under deleted fields and can be restored"],"explanation":"Deleted fields can be restored within 15 days (minus some metadata)."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"Un administrador no puede borrar un campo personalizado. ¿Cuál es una causa típica?","options":["Está referenciado en una fórmula, flujo o código","Que el objeto es estándar","Que el campo tiene datos en más de diez registros","Que el usuario no es su creador"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Salesforce impide borrar campos referenciados (Where is this used? ayuda a encontrarlos).","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"An admin can't delete a custom field. What's a typical cause?","options":["It's referenced in a formula, flow or code","The object is standard","The field has data in more than ten records","The user isn't its creator"],"explanation":"Salesforce blocks deleting referenced fields (Where is this used? helps find them)."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué consecuencia tiene cambiar el tipo de un campo de texto a número?","options":["Ninguna, Salesforce convierte siempre cualquier texto a número sin pérdida","Se crea un campo nuevo","Se borra el objeto","Se pueden perder datos que no sean numéricos"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Cambiar el tipo de campo puede truncar o perder datos; conviene revisar antes.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's a consequence of changing a field from text to number?","options":["None, Salesforce always converts any text to number losslessly","A new field is created","The object is deleted","Non-numeric data may be lost"],"explanation":"Changing field type can truncate or lose data; review first."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"Un campo debe ser obligatorio siempre, incluso al cargar datos por API. ¿Dónde se marca?","options":["En la definición del campo (Required)","En el diseño de página, que también obliga en cargas de API","En la vista de lista","En el perfil"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Required a nivel de campo se aplica en todas las vías; el del diseño de página solo en la interfaz.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A field must always be required, even on API loads. Where is it set?","options":["On the field definition (Required)","On the page layout, which also enforces on API loads","On the list view","On the profile"],"explanation":"Field-level required applies everywhere; page layout required only in the UI."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos elementos se definen en un diseño de página (page layout)? (Elige 2)","options":["Orden y secciones de los campos","Las reglas de colaboración del objeto","Los valores de la lista de selección","Listas relacionadas y botones","Seguridad a nivel de campo para cada perfil de la organización"],"correct":[0,3],"explanation":"El page layout organiza campos, listas relacionadas, botones y acciones.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two items are defined in a page layout? (Choose 2)","options":["Field order and sections","The object's sharing rules","Picklist values","Related lists and buttons","Field-level security for every org profile"],"explanation":"The page layout arranges fields, related lists, buttons and actions."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué determina qué diseño de página ve un usuario?","options":["Su idioma","Su rol en la jerarquía y el propietario del registro","La app","La combinación de su perfil y el tipo de registro"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Page Layout Assignment se basa en perfil y record type.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What determines which page layout a user sees?","options":["Their language","Their hierarchy role and the record owner","The app","The combination of their profile and record type"],"explanation":"Page Layout Assignment is based on profile and record type."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"En Lightning, un campo debe aparecer solo cuando el estado sea Cerrado. ¿Qué lo permite sin código?","options":["Dynamic Forms con reglas de visibilidad","Una regla de validación","Crear un tipo de registro distinto para cada estado del caso","Un perfil por estado"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Dynamic Forms permite visibilidad condicional de campos y secciones.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"In Lightning, a field should appear only when status is Closed. What allows it without code?","options":["Dynamic Forms with visibility rules","A validation rule","Creating a separate record type for each case status","A profile per status"],"explanation":"Dynamic Forms allows conditional field and section visibility."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos criterios pueden usar las reglas de visibilidad de componentes en Lightning App Builder? (Elige 2)","options":["Valores de campos del registro","La versión del navegador","Permisos o perfil del usuario","La hora del servidor de Salesforce en la zona horaria corporativa","Los informes ejecutados recientemente por el usuario"],"correct":[0,2],"explanation":"La visibilidad se basa en campos del registro, usuario, permisos y dispositivo.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two criteria can component visibility rules in Lightning App Builder use? (Choose 2)","options":["Record field values","Browser version","User permissions or profile","Salesforce server time in the corporate time zone","Reports the user ran recently"],"explanation":"Visibility is based on record fields, user, permissions and form factor."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué se necesita para que una página de registro Lightning personalizada la vean solo los usuarios de una app y perfil concretos?","options":["Activarla como asignación de app, tipo de registro y perfil","Compartirla en una carpeta","Crear un rol","Asignarla como predeterminada de la organización para que todos la vean"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"La activación de páginas Lightning admite org default, app default o app+record type+profile.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's needed so a custom Lightning record page is seen only by one app and profile's users?","options":["Activate it as an app, record type and profile assignment","Share it in a folder","Create a role","Set it as org default so everyone sees it"],"explanation":"Lightning page activation supports org default, app default or app+record type+profile."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué es una acción rápida específica de objeto (object-specific action)?","options":["Un informe","Un flujo programado","Una acción que aparece en la cabecera global fuera de los registros","Una acción que crea o actualiza registros relacionados con el registro actual"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Las acciones específicas trabajan en contexto del registro (crear relacionado, actualizar, etc.).","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What is an object-specific quick action?","options":["A report","A scheduled flow","An action shown in the global header outside records","An action creating or updating records related to the current record"],"explanation":"Object-specific actions work in the record's context (create related, update, etc.)."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué permite predefinir valores en una acción rápida, por ejemplo el estado Nuevo al crear un caso desde la cuenta?","options":["Un diseño de lista","Un perfil","Valores de campo predefinidos de la acción","Una regla de validación que rellena el campo al guardar"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Predefined Field Values asignan valores por defecto en la acción.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What lets you prefill values in a quick action, e.g. status New when creating a case from the account?","options":["A list layout","A profile","The action's predefined field values","A validation rule that fills the field on save"],"explanation":"Predefined Field Values set defaults in the action."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"Un administrador añade un campo nuevo, pero los usuarios no lo ven. Está en el diseño de página. ¿Qué falta probablemente?","options":["Dar visibilidad en la seguridad a nivel de campo","Añadirlo también a la jerarquía de roles de los usuarios","Crear un tipo de registro","Recalcular la colaboración"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"El campo debe estar en el layout y ser visible por FLS.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"An admin adds a new field but users can't see it. It's on the page layout. What's likely missing?","options":["Making it visible in field-level security","Also adding it to the users' role hierarchy","Creating a record type","Recalculating sharing"],"explanation":"The field must be on the layout and visible via FLS."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué función tiene el formato de un campo de numeración automática (auto number)?","options":["Validar números de teléfono","Generar un identificador secuencial con un patrón, p. ej. FAC-{0000}","Calcular un número a partir de otros campos del registro","Contar registros hijos"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Auto Number asigna números secuenciales con prefijo.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does an auto number field's display format do?","options":["Validate phone numbers","Generate a sequential ID with a pattern, e.g. INV-{0000}","Calculate a number from other record fields","Count child records"],"explanation":"Auto Number assigns sequential numbers with a prefix."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué limitación tiene un campo roll-up summary?","options":["Que no admite filtros","Que solo cuenta registros","Que puede resumir cualquier objeto de la organización aunque no esté relacionado","Solo resume registros detalle de una relación principal-detalle"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Roll-up resume detalles directos con COUNT, SUM, MIN o MAX y admite filtros.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What limitation does a roll-up summary field have?","options":["It doesn't support filters","It only counts records","It can summarize any org object even if unrelated","It only summarizes detail records of a master-detail relationship"],"explanation":"Roll-up summarizes direct details with COUNT, SUM, MIN or MAX and supports filters."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué filtro limita los registros que se pueden seleccionar en un campo de búsqueda?","options":["Una regla de colaboración en el objeto relacionado","Un filtro de búsqueda (lookup filter)","Una vista de lista","Una lista dependiente"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Los lookup filters restringen valores válidos, obligatorios u opcionales.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which filter limits the records that can be selected in a lookup field?","options":["A sharing rule on the related object","A lookup filter","A list view","A dependent picklist"],"explanation":"Lookup filters restrict valid values, required or optional."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ocurre al borrar un objeto personalizado?","options":["Se borra para siempre al instante junto con todos los informes de la organización","Se puede restaurar durante 15 días junto con sus datos","Nada","Se convierte en objeto estándar"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Los objetos borrados se mantienen 15 días; algunos elementos dependientes no se restauran.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What happens when a custom object is deleted?","options":["It's permanently deleted at once along with all org reports","It can be restored within 15 days with its data","Nothing","It becomes a standard object"],"explanation":"Deleted objects are kept 15 days; some dependents aren't restored."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos efectos tiene borrar el campo principal-detalle de un objeto detalle? (Elige 2)","options":["Los roll-up summary que dependen de él dejan de funcionar","Se borra el objeto principal con todos sus registros","El objeto detalle pasa a tener propietario propio y su OWD se define de nuevo","Se cambia el nombre del objeto","Se crea una regla de validación"],"correct":[0,2],"explanation":"Sin master-detail, los roll-ups dependientes no pueden existir y el objeto necesita propietario y OWD.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two effects does deleting a detail object's master-detail field have? (Choose 2)","options":["Roll-up summaries depending on it stop working","The master object is deleted with all its records","The detail object gets its own owner and its OWD is redefined","The object is renamed","A validation rule is created"],"explanation":"Without master-detail, dependent roll-ups can't exist and the object needs an owner and OWD."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Para qué se usa un campo de lista de selección de varios valores (multi-select)?","options":["Relacionar el registro con varios registros de otro objeto","Elegir varios valores de una lista","Guardar texto largo","Calcular totales"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Multi-select permite varios valores, con limitaciones en informes y fórmulas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What is a multi-select picklist used for?","options":["Relating the record to several records of another object","Choosing several values from a list","Storing long text","Calculating totals"],"explanation":"Multi-select allows several values, with limits in reports and formulas."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de campo almacena una URL de imagen o enlace clicable?","options":["Texto enriquecido con un límite de 255 caracteres sin formato","Fórmula de número","URL","Búsqueda"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"El tipo URL muestra un enlace clicable.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which field type stores a clickable link?","options":["Rich text with a 255-character plain limit","Number formula","URL","Lookup"],"explanation":"The URL type shows a clickable link."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"Un tipo de registro debe ofrecer solo algunas etapas de oportunidad. ¿Qué se configura?","options":["Una regla de validación por cada etapa no permitida","Un perfil nuevo","Una lista dependiente de la etapa","Un proceso de ventas (sales process) asignado al tipo de registro"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Los sales processes limitan las etapas disponibles por record type.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A record type should offer only some opportunity stages. What's configured?","options":["A validation rule for each disallowed stage","A new profile","A stage-dependent picklist","A sales process assigned to the record type"],"explanation":"Sales processes limit available stages per record type."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos procesos especiales asocian valores de estado a tipos de registro en objetos estándar? (Elige 2)","options":["Proceso de soporte (casos)","Proceso de leads","Proceso de informes","Proceso de aprobación de cuentas","Proceso de colaboración por criterios"],"correct":[0,1],"explanation":"Support process, lead process, sales process y solution process limitan estados.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two special processes tie status values to record types on standard objects? (Choose 2)","options":["Support process (cases)","Lead process","Report process","Account approval process","Criteria sharing process"],"explanation":"Support, lead, sales and solution processes limit statuses."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué es una página compacta (compact layout)?","options":["Un informe resumido","Los campos clave que aparecen en la cabecera del registro y en la app móvil","Una vista de lista","Un diseño de página reducido que sustituye al principal en escritorio"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"El compact layout define los campos destacados del registro.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What is a compact layout?","options":["A summary report","Key fields shown in the record header and mobile app","A list view","A reduced page layout that replaces the main one on desktop"],"explanation":"The compact layout defines a record's highlighted fields."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"Un administrador quiere que el campo Teléfono acepte solo números con un formato concreto. ¿Qué usa?","options":["Una regla de validación con REGEX","Cambiar el tipo de campo a número con decimales","Un campo de fórmula","Una lista de selección"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Las reglas de validación con REGEX comprueban formatos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"An admin wants Phone to accept only numbers in a specific format. What do they use?","options":["A validation rule with REGEX","Change the field type to number with decimals","A formula field","A picklist"],"explanation":"Validation rules with REGEX check formats."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tiene que evaluar a verdadero una regla de validación para mostrar el error?","options":["La fórmula de éxito: si es verdadera, se permite y si es falsa se bloquea","Nada","El usuario","La fórmula de error: si es verdadera, se bloquea el guardado"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"La regla se dispara cuando su fórmula devuelve TRUE.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What must a validation rule evaluate to for the error to show?","options":["The success formula: true allows, false blocks","Nothing","The user","The error formula: if true, save is blocked"],"explanation":"The rule fires when its formula returns TRUE."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Dónde puede mostrarse el mensaje de error de una regla de validación?","options":["En la parte superior de la página o junto a un campo","En Chatter","Solo en un correo enviado al administrador del sistema","En un informe"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"El error se muestra arriba o junto al campo elegido.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Where can a validation rule's error message show?","options":["At the top of the page or next to a field","In Chatter","Only in an email to the system admin","In a report"],"explanation":"The error shows at the top or next to the chosen field."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ocurre con los datos existentes al activar una regla de validación nueva?","options":["Se revisan todos al instante y se bloquean los inválidos","No se comprueban hasta que se editan y guardan","Se borran los inválidos","Se marcan en un informe"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Las reglas se evalúan al guardar; los registros antiguos se validan cuando se editan.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What happens to existing data when a new validation rule is activated?","options":["All are checked at once and invalid ones locked","It isn't checked until edited and saved","Invalid ones are deleted","They're flagged in a report"],"explanation":"Rules evaluate on save; old records are validated when edited."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"Un campo de fórmula debe mostrar \"Grande\" si el importe supera 100.000 y \"Normal\" en otro caso. ¿Qué función se usa?","options":["VLOOKUP con una tabla de rangos de importe definida en otro objeto","PRIORVALUE","ISCHANGED","IF"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"IF(Amount > 100000, \"Grande\", \"Normal\").","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A formula must show \"Large\" if amount exceeds 100,000 and \"Normal\" otherwise. Which function is used?","options":["VLOOKUP with an amount range table defined on another object","PRIORVALUE","ISCHANGED","IF"],"explanation":"IF(Amount > 100000, \"Large\", \"Normal\")."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué función se usa en una fórmula para comparar el valor de una lista de selección?","options":["Un operador de igualdad directo sobre el campo, como en los textos","CONTAINS","LEN","ISPICKVAL"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Las listas de selección se comparan con ISPICKVAL o se convierten con TEXT.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which function compares a picklist value in a formula?","options":["A direct equality operator on the field, like text","CONTAINS","LEN","ISPICKVAL"],"explanation":"Picklists are compared with ISPICKVAL or converted with TEXT."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"Una regla de validación solo debe aplicarse cuando cambia el campo Etapa. ¿Qué función ayuda?","options":["ISNEW, que detecta cambios en cualquier campo del registro","TODAY","BLANKVALUE","ISCHANGED"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"ISCHANGED detecta cambios en un campo durante la edición.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A validation rule should apply only when Stage changes. Which function helps?","options":["ISNEW, which detects changes to any record field","TODAY","BLANKVALUE","ISCHANGED"],"explanation":"ISCHANGED detects changes to a field during edit."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos funciones sirven para tratar campos vacíos en fórmulas? (Elige 2)","options":["ISBLANK","PRIORVALUE para recuperar el último valor no vacío","LEFT","BLANKVALUE","ISPICKVAL aplicada a campos de texto y número"],"correct":[0,3],"explanation":"ISBLANK comprueba vacío; BLANKVALUE sustituye un vacío por otro valor.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two functions handle blank fields in formulas? (Choose 2)","options":["ISBLANK","PRIORVALUE to retrieve the last non-blank value","LEFT","BLANKVALUE","ISPICKVAL applied to text and number fields"],"explanation":"ISBLANK checks blank; BLANKVALUE substitutes a blank with another value."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué impacto tiene en los registros existentes añadir un campo fórmula nuevo?","options":["Se calcula al instante para todos sin cargar datos","Solo afecta a registros nuevos","Ninguno hasta el día siguiente","Hay que actualizar cada registro con Data Loader para que el campo tenga valor"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Las fórmulas se calculan al leerse; no almacenan datos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What impact on existing records does adding a new formula field have?","options":["It calculates immediately for all without loading data","It only affects new records","None until the next day","Each record must be updated with Data Loader for it to have a value"],"explanation":"Formulas calculate on read; they don't store data."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"Un objeto personalizado nuevo no aparece en la barra de navegación. ¿Qué falta?","options":["Crear su pestaña y añadirla a la app","Activar el permiso View All Data en todos los perfiles","Una regla de colaboración","Crear un rol"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Para navegar a un objeto hace falta una pestaña visible en la app.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A new custom object doesn't show in the navigation bar. What's missing?","options":["Creating its tab and adding it to the app","Enabling View All Data on every profile","A sharing rule","Creating a role"],"explanation":"To navigate to an object you need a tab visible in the app."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué opción de objeto personalizado hay que activar para poder registrar el historial de sus campos?","options":["Allow Activities","Allow Reports, que también guarda el historial de los cambios","Deployment Status","Track Field History"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Track Field History habilita el seguimiento de hasta 20 campos por objeto.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which custom object option must be enabled to track its field history?","options":["Allow Activities","Allow Reports, which also stores change history","Deployment Status","Track Field History"],"explanation":"Track Field History enables tracking up to 20 fields per object."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Cuántos campos por objeto se pueden seguir con el historial de campos estándar?","options":["20","Todos los campos del objeto sin límite","5","100"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"El historial de campos estándar admite 20 campos por objeto (más con Field Audit Trail).","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"How many fields per object can standard field history track?","options":["20","All object fields without limit","5","100"],"explanation":"Standard field history supports 20 fields per object (more with Field Audit Trail)."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"Los usuarios deben poder registrar llamadas y tareas en un objeto personalizado. ¿Qué opción se activa?","options":["Allow Activities","Track Field History, que añade la línea de actividades","Allow Search","Enable Divisions"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Allow Activities habilita tareas y eventos relacionados.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Users must log calls and tasks on a custom object. Which option is enabled?","options":["Allow Activities","Track Field History, which adds the activity timeline","Allow Search","Enable Divisions"],"explanation":"Allow Activities enables related tasks and events."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué impacto tiene cambiar un objeto de \"En desarrollo\" a \"Desplegado\" (Deployment Status)?","options":["Ninguno","Borra sus datos de prueba","Lo hace visible a usuarios sin permiso Customize Application","Lo copia automáticamente a todas las sandboxes y a producción"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"En desarrollo, solo lo ven usuarios con Customize Application.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does changing an object from In Development to Deployed do?","options":["Nothing","Deletes its test data","Makes it visible to users without Customize Application","Copies it automatically to all sandboxes and production"],"explanation":"In Development, only Customize Application users see it."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"Los usuarios ven el campo Descuento en el diseño de página pero no pueden editarlo, y el administrador no lo marcó como solo lectura en el diseño. ¿Qué lo explica?","options":["Que el usuario es propietario","La FLS lo da como solo lectura","Que el diseño de página siempre prevalece y lo convierte en editable","Que es un campo obligatorio"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Se aplica la opción más restrictiva entre FLS y diseño de página.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Users see Discount on the page layout but can't edit it, and the admin didn't set it read-only on the layout. Why?","options":["The user is the owner","FLS sets it read-only","The page layout always wins and makes it editable","It's a required field"],"explanation":"The most restrictive of FLS and page layout applies."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué limitación hay al asignar varios tipos de registro a un perfil?","options":["Uno debe ser el predeterminado","No se puede asignar más de un tipo de registro por perfil y objeto","Ninguna","Todos deben tener el mismo diseño"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Un perfil puede tener varios record types disponibles con uno por defecto.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's the constraint when assigning several record types to a profile?","options":["One must be the default","No more than one record type per profile and object","None","All must share a layout"],"explanation":"A profile can have several record types available with one default."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"Un administrador desactiva un tipo de registro. ¿Qué pasa con los registros que lo usan?","options":["Se bloquean","Se borran de inmediato junto con su historial de campos","Lo conservan, pero no se puede elegir en registros nuevos","Pasan al tipo maestro"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Desactivar un record type impide usarlo en nuevos registros sin afectar a los existentes.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"An admin deactivates a record type. What happens to records using it?","options":["They're locked","They're deleted at once with their field history","They keep it, but it can't be chosen for new records","They move to the master type"],"explanation":"Deactivating a record type stops new use without affecting existing records."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué herramienta permite crear campos rápidamente en un objeto desde un diagrama?","options":["Lightning App Builder, desde la página de registro del objeto","Schema Builder","Report Builder","Flow Builder"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"En Schema Builder se arrastran campos y relaciones al diagrama.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which tool lets you quickly create fields on an object from a diagram?","options":["Lightning App Builder, from the object's record page","Schema Builder","Report Builder","Flow Builder"],"explanation":"In Schema Builder you drag fields and relationships onto the diagram."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"Un campo de texto debe tener valores únicos (p. ej. código de cliente). ¿Qué se marca?","options":["ID externo sin más opciones, que garantiza unicidad","Encriptado","Único (Unique)","Obligatorio"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"El atributo Unique impide duplicados; External ID ayuda en upserts y puede combinarse.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A text field must have unique values (e.g. customer code). What's set?","options":["External ID alone, which guarantees uniqueness","Encrypted","Unique","Required"],"explanation":"The Unique attribute prevents duplicates; External ID helps upserts and can be combined."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Para qué se marca un campo como ID externo (External ID)?","options":["Para ocultar el campo a todos los usuarios excepto el administrador","Para que sea obligatorio","Para cifrar su valor","Para hacer upsert y relacionar registros con sistemas externos"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Los External IDs se indexan y se usan para coincidencias en cargas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Why mark a field as External ID?","options":["To hide the field from everyone but the admin","To make it required","To encrypt its value","To upsert and match records with external systems"],"explanation":"External IDs are indexed and used for matching in loads."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"Un administrador debe crear un campo que sume el importe de los productos de oportunidad. ¿Dónde y de qué tipo?","options":["Roll-up summary en Oportunidad","Campo de número manual","Búsqueda en Oportunidad","Fórmula en Producto de oportunidad que sume todos sus hermanos"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Oportunidad y Producto de oportunidad tienen relación tipo master-detail; el roll-up va en el principal.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"An admin must create a field summing opportunity product amounts. Where and what type?","options":["Roll-up summary on Opportunity","Manual number field","