os relacionados con el principal","Cambiar el propietario de los hijos"],"correct":[0,2],"explanation":"Opciones: clear the value, don't allow deletion y, en algunos casos, delete this record also.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two delete behaviors can a custom lookup have? (Choose 2)","options":["Don't allow deletion of the parent","Move children to the admin's recycle bin","Clear the field value","Always delete records of every object related to the parent","Change the children's owner"],"explanation":"Options: clear the value, don't allow deletion and, in some cases, delete this record also."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"Los usuarios deben ver una lista de contactos relacionados con la cuenta en la página de registro Lightning. ¿Qué componente se usa?","options":["Lista relacionada (Related List)","Un campo fórmula","Un componente de informe enriquecido que se recalcula cada hora","Una acción global"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Los componentes Related List / Related List - Single muestran registros hijos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Users must see a list of the account's contacts on the Lightning record page. Which component?","options":["Related List","A formula field","A rich report component recalculated hourly","A global action"],"explanation":"Related List / Related List - Single components show child records."}}},{"domain":"D2","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ocurre si se asigna un diseño de página a un perfil y luego se crea un tipo de registro nuevo?","options":["Hay que asignar el diseño para la nueva combinación perfil-tipo","El nuevo tipo hereda automáticamente el diseño más reciente que haya editado cualquier usuario","Se borra el diseño","Ninguno"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"La asignación de layouts se define por cada combinación perfil-record type.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What happens if a layout is assigned to a profile and then a new record type is created?","options":["The layout must be assigned for the new profile-type combination","The 