ility"],"explanation":"Stages include probability, forecast category and open/won/lost type."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué herramienta permite a los directores ver la previsión de ventas por trimestre y ajustar cifras?","options":["Path","Un informe tabular de oportunidades cerradas ganadas del año anterior","Collaborative Forecasts","Lead scoring"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Collaborative Forecasts agrega oportunidades y permite ajustes de managers.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which tool lets managers view quarterly sales forecasts and adjust numbers?","options":["Path","A tabular report of last year's closed-won opportunities","Collaborative Forecasts","Lead scoring"],"explanation":"Collaborative Forecasts rolls up opportunities and allows manager adjustments."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué determina en qué fila de la previsión aparece una oportunidad?","options":["Su divisa","La categoría de previsión de su etapa","El tipo de registro de la cuenta relacionada","Su propietario anterior"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Pipeline, Best Case, Commit, Closed y Omitted dependen de la categoría.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What determines which forecast row an opportunity appears in?","options":["Its currency","Its stage's forecast category","The related account's record type","Its previous owner"],"explanation":"Pipeline, Best Case, Commit, Closed and Omitted depend on category."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué jerarquía usan por defecto las previsiones colaborativas para agregar?","options":["La de perfiles","La jerarquía de previsiones, basada en la de roles","La de colas","La jerarquía de territorios siempre, sin posibilidad de cambio"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"La forecast hierarchy se basa en roles (o territorios si se configura).","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which hierarchy do collaborative forecasts use by default to roll up?","options":["The profile hierarchy","The forecast hierarchy, based on roles","The queue hierarchy","Al