th a single value","Scatter","Metric","Funnel"],"explanation":"A funnel visualizes stage progression."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué es Salesforce Backup?","options":["Un informe","El servicio de exportación semanal que restaura automáticamente","Un tipo de sandbox","Una solución de Salesforce para copias y restauración de datos y metadatos"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Salesforce Backup permite programar copias y restaurar.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What is Salesforce Backup?","options":["A report","The weekly export service that restores automatically","A sandbox type","A Salesforce solution to back up and restore data and metadata"],"explanation":"Salesforce Backup schedules backups and restores."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"Un usuario modifica un informe en una carpeta con acceso Visualizador. ¿Qué puede hacer?","options":["Guardarlo como un informe nuevo en otra carpeta","Cambiar el acceso de la carpeta","Guardar los cambios sobre el informe original","Borrar el informe"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Viewer solo permite ver; puede usar Guardar como en una carpeta propia.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A user edits a report in a folder where they're Viewer. What can they do?","options":["Save it as a new report in another folder","Change the folder access","Save the changes over the original","Delete the report"],"explanation":"Viewer only views; they can Save As to their own folder."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos datos ofrece el informe \"Informes sin usar\" o el análisis de uso de informes? (Elige 2)","options":["Última ejecución","Los registros borrados","Informes candidatos a limpieza","Las contraseñas","El OWD de los objetos"],"correct":[0,2],"explanation":"Report usage ayuda a limpiar informes obsoletos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two insights does a report usage analysis give? (Choose 2)","options":["Last run date","Deleted records","Reports that are cleanup candidates","Passwords","Object OWDs"],"explanation":"Report usage helps clean up stale reports."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de filtro limita un informe a filas donde Importe > 50.000 y Etapa = Negociación, con lógica personalizada (1 AND 2) OR 3?","options":["Lógica de filtros (filter logic)","Un filtro cruzado","Un bucket con tres categorías","Una fórmula de resumen"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Filter logic combina filtros con AND, OR y NOT.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which filter feature limits rows with custom logic like (1 AND 2) OR 3?","options":["Filter logic","A cross filter","A bucket with three categories","A summary formula"],"explanation":"Filter logic combines filters with AND, OR and NOT."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué hace la opción de informe \"Mostrar detalles\" desactivada?","options":["Oculta los totales y muestra solo las filas de detalle","Exporta los datos","Borra los registros","Muestra solo agrupaciones y totales"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Ocultar detalles deja la vista de resumen.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does turning off Show Details in a report do?","options":["Hides totals and shows only detail rows","Exports data","Deletes records","Shows only groupings and totals"],"explanation":"Hiding details leaves the summary view."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"Según Salesforce, ¿qué herramienta declarativa se recomienda para nuevas automatizaciones?","options":["Reglas de validación con fórmulas complejas para cada caso","Flow Builder","Apex en todos los casos, incluso para cambios sencillos","Workflow Rules y Process Builder, que siguen siendo la opción recomendada"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Workflow Rules y Process Builder están retirados para nuevas automatizaciones; se migran a Flow.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Per Salesforce, which declarative tool is recommended for new automation?","options":["Validation rules with complex formulas for each case","Flow Builder","Apex in every case, even for simple changes","Workflow Rules and Process Builder, still the recommended option"],"explanation":"Workflow Rules and Process Builder are retired for new automation; migrate to Flow."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"Al crear una oportunidad, debe rellenarse un campo del mismo registro antes de guardarlo y de la forma más eficiente. ¿Qué flujo se usa?","options":["Flujo de pantalla lanzado desde un botón","Flujo desencadenado por registro optimizado para actualizaciones rápidas (before-save)","Flujo programado que se ejecuta cada noche","Flujo desencadenado por registro after-save que vuelve a actualizar el mismo registro"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Los before-save (Fast Field Updates) actualizan el registro sin DML extra.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"When an opportunity is created, a field on the same record must be set before save, most efficiently. Which flow?","options":["Screen flow launched from a button","Record-triggered flow optimized for Fast Field Updates (before-save)","Scheduled flow running nightly","After-save record-triggered flow that updates the same record again"],"explanation":"Before-save (Fast Field Updates) update the record with no extra DML."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"Al cerrar un caso hay que crear una tarea de seguimiento relacionada. ¿Qué tipo de flujo desencadenado por registro se usa?","options":["After-save (acciones y registros relacionados)","Un flujo de pantalla que el agente lanza manualmente","Before-save, que permite crear registros relacionados sin límites","Un flujo de plataforma que escucha correos"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Crear registros relacionados requiere after-save.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"When a case closes a related follow-up task must be created. Which record-triggered flow type?","options":["After-save (actions and related records)","A screen flow the agent launches manually","Before-save, which can create related records without limits","A platform flow listening to emails"],"explanation":"Creating related records requires after-save."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de flujo guía al usuario con pantallas y campos de entrada?","options":["Flujo programado","Flujo autolanzado sin pantallas","Flujo de pantalla","Flujo desencadenado por registro en modo before-save"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Screen flows muestran pantallas al usuario.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which flow type guides the user with screens and inputs?","options":["Scheduled flow","Autolaunched flow with no screens","Screen flow","Before-save record-triggered flow"],"explanation":"Screen flows show screens to the user."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"Cada lunes hay que revisar los contratos que caducan en 30 días y notificar al propietario. ¿Qué tipo de flujo?","options":["Flujo de pantalla en la página de inicio de cada comercial","Flujo before-save en el objeto contrato","Flujo desencadenado por programación","Regla de validación con fecha"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Los schedule-triggered flows se ejecutan periódicamente sobre un conjunto de registros.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Every Monday, contracts expiring in 30 days must be reviewed and owners notified. Which flow type?","options":["A screen flow on each rep's Home page","Before-save flow on the contract object","Schedule-triggered flow","Validation rule with a date"],"explanation":"Schedule-triggered flows run periodically over a record set."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"Un flujo debe enviar un recordatorio 3 días antes de la fecha de cierre de una oportunidad. ¿Qué elemento de flujo lo permite?","options":["Una ruta programada (scheduled path) del flujo desencadenado por registro","Un elemento Pausa en un flujo before-save que espera tres días","Un informe programado con condición","Una regla de validación con la función TODAY"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Las scheduled paths ejecutan acciones en un momento relativo a una fecha del registro.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A flow must send a reminder 3 days before an opportunity's close date. Which flow feature enables it?","options":["A scheduled path in the record-triggered flow","A Pause element in a before-save flow that waits three days","A scheduled report with a condition","A validation rule with TODAY"],"explanation":"Scheduled paths run actions at a time relative to a record date."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de flujo se ejecuta desde otro flujo, Apex o la API, sin interfaz?","options":["Flujo de pantalla con una sola pantalla oculta","Flujo programado sin registros","Flujo desencadenado por plataforma de correos","Flujo autolanzado (autolaunched)"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Los autolaunched flows no tienen pantallas y se invocan desde otros procesos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which flow type runs from another flow, Apex or the API, with no UI?","options":["Screen flow with a single hidden screen","Scheduled flow with no records","Email platform-triggered flow","Autolaunched flow"],"explanation":"Autolaunched flows have no screens and are invoked by other processes."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué elemento de flujo evalúa condiciones y toma caminos distintos?","options":["Decisión","Obtener registros","Bucle","Asignación"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Decision crea ramas según condiciones.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which flow element evaluates conditions and takes different paths?","options":["Decision","Get Records","Loop","Assignment"],"explanation":"Decision creates branches by conditions."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué buena práctica evita superar los límites de DML en un flujo que procesa muchos registros?","options":["No poner elementos Crear o Actualizar registros dentro de un bucle","Duplicar el flujo para cada registro afectado","Desactivar las reglas de validación del objeto","Usar un elemento Actualizar registros por cada iteración del bucle para mayor claridad"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Se acumulan cambios en una colección y se hace un único DML tras el bucle.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which best practice avoids DML limits in a flow processing many records?","options":["Don't put Create or Update Records elements inside a loop","Duplicate the flow for each affected record","Disable the object's validation rules","Use an Update Records element per loop iteration for clarity"],"explanation":"Collect changes in a collection and do a single DML after the loop."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué elemento de flujo consulta registros de Salesforce?","options":["Pantalla","Obtener registros (Get Records)","Decisión","Asignación, que lee registros de la base de datos"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Get Records consulta con filtros y orden.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which flow element queries Salesforce records?","options":["Screen","Get Records","Decision","Assignment, which reads records from the database"],"explanation":"Get Records queries with filters and sorting."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos acciones puede realizar un flujo sin código? (Elige 2)","options":["Enviar un correo electrónico","Crear un perfil nuevo y asignarlo a usuarios automáticamente","Enviar una notificación personalizada","Modificar la jerarquía de roles en producción","Cambiar el OWD de un objeto según condiciones del registro"],"correct":[0,2],"explanation":"Flow tiene acciones de email, notificaciones, Chatter, aprobaciones y más.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two actions can a flow perform without code? (Choose 2)","options":["Send an email","Create a new profile and auto-assign it to users","Send a custom notification","Modify the role hierarchy in production","Change an object's OWD based on record conditions"],"explanation":"Flow has email, notification, Chatter, approval actions and more."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué recurso de flujo almacena un valor que puede cambiar durante la ejecución?","options":["Plantilla de texto","Fórmula de flujo que se recalcula sin asignaciones","Variable","Constante"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Las variables almacenan valores modificables; las constantes no cambian.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which flow resource stores a value that can change during execution?","options":["Text template","A flow formula recalculated without assignments","Variable","Constant"],"explanation":"Variables store changeable values; constants don't change."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"Un flujo desencadenado por registro debe ejecutarse solo cuando el campo Estado cambia a Cerrado, no en cada edición. ¿Qué opción se configura?","options":["Ejecutar solo cuando el registro se actualiza para cumplir las condiciones","Ejecutar solo al crear el registro","Ejecutar cada vez que se actualiza un registro que cumple las condiciones","Ejecutar al borrar el registro"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"\"Only when a record is updated to meet the condition requirements\" evita repeticiones.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A record-triggered flow must run only when Status changes to Closed, not on every edit. What's set?","options":["Run only when a record is updated to meet the conditions","Run only on create","Run every time a record meeting the conditions is updated","Run on delete"],"explanation":"\"Only when a record is updated to meet the condition requirements\" avoids repeats."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué permite el elemento Bucle en un flujo?","options":["Consultar registros de otros objetos","Mostrar pantallas","Recorrer una colección de registros o valores","Repetir el flujo completo desde el principio hasta que falle"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Loop itera una colección elemento a elemento.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does the Loop element do in a flow?","options":["Query other objects' records","Show screens","Iterate through a collection of records or values","Repeat the entire flow from the start until it fails"],"explanation":"Loop iterates a collection item by item."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué herramienta ayuda a migrar Workflow 