s","Login history","Flow error emails","Import Wizard"],"explanation":"Debug simulates runs; error emails show the failure."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"Un flujo falla y el usuario ve un error genérico. ¿Qué elemento permite gestionar el fallo y mostrar un mensaje propio?","options":["Un elemento Decisión antes de cada elemento","Un bucle que reintenta indefinidamente","Una ruta de fallo (fault path)","Una regla de validación en el objeto"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Los fault connectors gestionan errores de elementos de datos o acciones.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A flow fails and the user sees a generic error. Which feature handles the failure and shows a custom message?","options":["A Decision before every element","A loop that retries indefinitely","A fault path","A validation rule on the object"],"explanation":"Fault connectors handle data or action element errors."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué es un proceso de aprobación?","options":["Un flujo de pantalla que bloquea el registro hasta que un administrador lo edita","Un proceso que envía registros a aprobadores y actúa según la respuesta","Una regla de validación que exige un campo Aprobado","Una cola de registros"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Approval processes definen pasos, aprobadores y acciones.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What is an approval process?","options":["A screen flow locking the record until an admin edits it","A process sending records to approvers and acting on the response","A validation rule requiring an Approved field","A record queue"],"explanation":"Approval processes define steps, approvers and actions."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ocurre por defecto con un registro enviado a aprobación?","options":["Se asigna a una cola","Se borra hasta que se apruebe","Se bloquea para edición salvo para administradores y aprobadores","Queda editable por cualquiera con acceso, sin cambios"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"El registro se bloquea al enviarse; acciones pueden desbloquearlo.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What happens by default to a record submitted for approval?","options":["It's assigned to a queue","It's deleted until approved","It's locked for edit except admins and approvers","It stays editable by anyone with access"],"explanation":"The record locks on submission; actions can unlock it."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos tipos de acciones puede tener un proceso de aprobación? (Elige 2)","options":["Acciones de creación de perfiles","Acciones de despliegue de metadatos","Acciones de aprobación o rechazo final","Acciones de envío inicial","Acciones de cambio de OWD del objeto aprobado"],"correct":[2,3],"explanation":"Initial submission, final approval, final rejection y recall actions.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two action types can an approval process have? (Choose 2)","options":["Profile creation actions","Metadata deployment actions","Final approval or rejection actions","Initial submission actions","Actions changing the approved object's OWD"],"explanation":"Initial submission, final approval, final rejection and recall actions."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"Un descuento mayor del 20 % debe aprobarlo el jefe del comercial. ¿Cómo se identifica al aprobador?","options":["Con una cola de todos los directores sin criterio","Con el OWD","Con el rol de la oportunidad, que siempre define el aprobador","Con el campo Manager del usuario o un campo de jerarquía"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"El aprobador puede ser el manager del remitente, un usuario, cola o campo.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A discount over 20% must be approved by the rep's manager. How is the approver identified?","options":["Via a queue of all directors with no criteria","Via the OWD","Via the opportunity role, which always defines the approver","Via the user's Manager field or a hierarchy field"],"explanation":"The approver can be the submitter's manager, a user, a queue or a field."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué permite un proceso de aprobación con varios pasos?","options":["Aprobar automáticamente sin aprobadores","Nada","Aprobaciones secuenciales con criterios distintos","Enviar el registro a todos los usuarios de la organización a la vez"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Cada paso puede tener criterios y aprobadores propios.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does a multi-step approval process allow?","options":["Auto-approving without approvers","Nothing","Sequential approvals with different criteria","Sending the record to every org user at once"],"explanation":"Each step can have its own criteria and approvers."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué opción permite que un paso de aprobación lo apruebe cualquiera de varios aprobadores o todos ellos?","options":["Un grupo de Chatter","Aprobación por el primero que responda o unánime","Una cola de casos","Un flujo de pantalla con una decisión por aprobador"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Con varios aprobadores se elige primera respuesta o unanimidad.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which option lets an approval step be approved by any one of several approvers or all of them?","options":["A Chatter group","First response or unanimous approval","A case queue","A screen flow with a decision per approver"],"explanation":"With multiple approvers choose first response or unanimous."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué herramienta sustituye a las reglas de flujo de trabajo (workflow) para enviar alertas de correo cuando cambia un campo?","options":["Un informe suscrito","Una regla de escalado","Un flujo desencadenado por registro con la acción Enviar alerta de correo","Una regla de validación con mensaje de error personalizado"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Flow puede usar Email Alerts existentes o enviar correos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which tool replaces workflow rules for sending email alerts when a field changes?","options":["A subscribed report","An escalation rule","A record-triggered flow with the Send Email Alert action","A validation rule with a custom error"],"explanation":"Flow can use existing Email Alerts or send emails."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué consideración tienen las actualizaciones entre objetos en un flujo after-save?","options":["Que no se pueden hacer","Pueden disparar otras automatizaciones del objeto relacionado","Que solo funcionan con objetos personalizados","Que nunca disparan otras automatizaciones porque están aisladas"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Actualizar otro objeto ejecuta su orden de ejecución, incluidos flujos y triggers.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's a consideration of cross-object updates in an after-save flow?","options":["They can't be done","They can fire the related object's automations","They only work with custom objects","They never fire other automations since they're isolated"],"explanation":"Updating another object runs its order of execution, including flows and triggers."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"Un administrador quiere controlar el orden en que se ejecutan varios flujos desencadenados por registro del mismo objeto. ¿Qué usa?","options":["Una regla de validación","El nombre alfabético de los flujos, que fija el orden","El orden de desencadenamiento (Trigger Order) del flujo","El orden de creación"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Trigger Order (1-2000) define la secuencia de flujos del mismo contexto.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"An admin wants to control the order of several record-triggered flows on one object. What do they use?","options":["A validation rule","Alphabetical flow names, which set the order","The flow's Trigger Order","Creation order"],"explanation":"Trigger Order (1-2000) defines sequence for flows in the same context."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué recomienda Salesforce sobre el número de flujos por objeto?","options":["No hay recomendación","Organizarlos con criterios de entrada claros y orden definido, evitando lógica duplicada","Un único flujo enorme por objeto obligatoriamente para todo","Un flujo por cada campo del objeto"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"La guía actual admite varios flujos con entry criteria y trigger order.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does Salesforce recommend on number of flows per object?","options":["No recommendation","Organize them with clear entry criteria and defined order, avoiding duplicated logic","A single huge flow per object mandatorily for everything","One flow per object field"],"explanation":"Current guidance allows several flows with entry criteria and trigger order."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de flujo reacciona a un mensaje de evento de plataforma?","options":["Flujo desencadenado por evento de plataforma","Flujo programado diario","Flujo before-save","Flujo de pantalla lanzado por un botón de lista"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Platform event-triggered flows se suscriben a eventos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which flow type reacts to a platform event message?","options":["Platform event-triggered flow","Daily scheduled flow","Before-save flow","Screen flow launched from a list button"],"explanation":"Platform event-triggered flows subscribe to events."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Dónde puede lanzarse un flujo de pantalla para los usuarios? (Elige 2)","options":["Como acción rápida","Como OWD del objeto","Como componente en una página Lightning","Como campo de fórmula en el diseño de página","Como regla de validación del objeto"],"correct":[0,2],"explanation":"Screen flows se lanzan desde páginas, acciones, botones, utility bar y sitios.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Where can a screen flow be launched for users? (Choose 2)","options":["As a quick action","As the object OWD","As a component on a Lightning page","As a formula field on the layout","As the object's validation rule"],"explanation":"Screen flows launch from pages, actions, buttons, utility bar and sites."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"Un flujo before-save debe actualizar la cuenta padre de una oportunidad. ¿Es posible?","options":["Solo si la cuenta es de un tipo concreto","Sí, before-save actualiza cualquier registro relacionado sin coste","No: before-save solo actualiza el registro que lo dispara","Solo con Data Loader"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Para otros registros se usa after-save.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A before-save flow must update an opportunity's parent account. Is it possible?","options":["Only for certain account types","Yes, before-save updates any related record at no cost","No: before-save only updates the triggering record","Only with Data Loader"],"explanation":"Use after-save for other records."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué variable global de flujo representa el registro que disparó un flujo desencadenado por registro?","options":["$Setup","$User, que contiene el registro modificado","$Record","$Flow.CurrentDate"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"$Record y $Record__Prior (valor previo) están disponibles.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which flow global variable represents the record that triggered a record-triggered flow?","options":["$Setup","$User, which holds the modified record","$Record","$Flow.CurrentDate"],"explanation":"$Record and $Record__Prior (prior value) are available."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Para qué sirve $Record__Prior en un flujo de actualización?","options":["Comparar el valor anterior de un campo con el nuevo","Acceder al registro padre","Nada","Restaurar el registro a su versión anterior automáticamente"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Permite detectar cambios concretos de valor.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What is $Record__Prior used for in an update flow?","options":["Comparing a field's prior value with the new one","Accessing the parent record","Nothing","Automatically restoring the record to its prior version"],"explanation":"It lets you detect specific value changes."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué limita cuántos registros puede procesar un flujo programado por lote?","options":["El año fiscal","Nada: los flujos programados no tienen límites","El número de usuarios activos","Los límites de gobernador por transacción, procesados en lotes"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Los flujos programados procesan en lotes y respetan límites.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What limits how many records a scheduled flow processes per batch?","options":["The fiscal year","Nothing: scheduled flows have no limits","The number of active users","Governor limits per transaction, processed in batches"],"explanation":"Scheduled flows process in batches and respect limits."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué herramienta se elige para lógica compleja que Flow no puede resolver de forma eficiente?","options":["Un informe unido","Un panel","Varias reglas de validación encadenadas entre sí","Apex, desarrollado por un programador"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"El código se reserva para requisitos que las herramientas declarativas no cubren.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which tool is chosen for complex logic Flow can't handle efficiently?","options":["A joined report","A dashboard","Several chained validation rules","Apex, built by a developer"],"explanation":"Code is reserved for requirements declarative tools can't meet."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"Al guardar una cuenta, hay que impedir guardar si falta el NIF. ¿Qué herramienta es la más adecuada?","options":["Un proceso de aprobación","Una regla de escalado","Un flujo after-save que borre el registro si falta el dato","Una regla de validación"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Bloquear datos inválidos es tarea de las reglas de validación.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"On account save, saving must be blocked if the tax ID is missing. Which tool fits best?","options":["An approval process","An escalation rule","An after-save flow deleting the record if missing","A validation rule"],"explanation":"Blocking invalid data is the job of validation rules."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos elementos componen un flujo desencadenado por registro? (Elige 2)","options":["Una carpeta de informes","Condiciones de entrada","Un tipo de registro obligatorio","Un perfil asignado al flujo para cada usuario","Objeto y evento desencadenante (crear, actualizar, borrar)"],"correct":[1,4],"explanation":"Se definen objeto, evento, condiciones y momento (before/after).","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two items make up a record-triggered flow? (Choose 2)","options":["A report folder","Entry conditions","A mandatory record type","A profile assigned to the flow per user","Object and trigger event (create, update, delete)"],"explanation":"You define object, event, conditions and timing (before/after)."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿En qué contexto de usuario se ejecuta un flujo desencadenado por registro por defecto?","options":["En el contexto del usuario con todas sus restricciones de colaboración","Como un usuario invitado","En contexto de sistema sin compartir","Como el administrador que lo creó"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Los record-triggered flows corren en system context without sharing.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"In which user context does a record-triggered flow run by default?","options":["The user's context with all sharing restrictions","As a guest user","System context without sharing","As the admin who created it"],"explanation":"Record-triggered flows run in system context without sharing."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué consideración hay al desactivar un flujo activo?","options":["Ninguna","Que se desactiva el objeto","Las entrevistas en pausa o rutas programadas pendientes pueden verse afectadas","Que el flujo se borra junto con todas sus versiones"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Revisar entrevistas pausadas y acciones programadas antes de desactivar.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's a consideration when deactivating an active flow?","options":["None","The object is deactivated","Paused interviews or pending scheduled paths may be affected","The flow is deleted with all its versions"],"explanation":"Review paused interviews and scheduled actions before deactivating."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ocurre al guardar cambios en un flujo activo?","options":["Se guarda como nueva versión que hay que activar","Se aplican de inmediato a la versión activa sin crear otra","Se borra la versión anterior","Nada"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Las versiones activas no se editan; se crea una nueva y se activa.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What happens when saving changes to an active flow?","options":["It's saved as a new version to activate","Changes apply immediately to the active version with no new one","The prior version is deleted","Nothing"],"explanation":"Active versions aren't edited; a new one is created and activated."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"Un usuario quiere retirar un registro que envió a aprobación por error. ¿Qué acción se configura?","options":["Permitir la recuperación (recall) por el remitente","Pedir al aprobador que lo rechace siempre","Borrar el proceso de aprobación y crear otro nuevo","Cambiar el propietario del registro"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"La opción de recall permite retirar la solicitud y tener acciones de recuperación.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A user wants to withdraw a record submitted for approval by mistake. What's configured?","options":["Allow submitters to recall","Always ask the approver to reject","Delete the approval process and create a new one","Change the record owner"],"explanation":"The recall option lets the submitter withdraw and run recall actions."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos formas tiene un aprobador de responder una solicitud? (Elige 2)","options":["Cambiando el perfil del remitente desde la configuración","Editando el OWD del objeto de la solicitud","Respondiendo al correo de aprobación si está habilitado","Desde la página del registro o la lista de elementos para aprobar","Ejecutando Data Loader sobre el o