ractive or background steps."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué hace el elemento Asignación en un flujo?","options":["Da o cambia valores de variables","Muestra una pantalla","Consulta registros","Asigna el registro a otro usuario como propietario de forma automática"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Assignment modifica variables, colecciones y campos de registros en memoria.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does the Assignment element do in a flow?","options":["Sets or changes variable values","Shows a screen","Queries records","Automatically reassigns the record to another owner"],"explanation":"Assignment modifies variables, collections and record fields in memory."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"Un flujo de pantalla debe mostrar campos del objeto con su validación y estilo nativos. ¿Qué componente usa?","options":["Un informe incrustado","Un elemento de bucle","Componentes de texto creados a mano para cada campo","Campos dinámicos (Record fields) en la pantalla"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Los campos de registro en pantalla respetan tipo y validaciones.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A screen flow must show object fields with native validation and style. Which component?","options":["An embedded report","A loop element","Hand-built text components for each field","Record fields on the screen"],"explanation":"Record fields on screens honor type and validations."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos opciones hacen que un campo de pantalla aparezca solo si se cumple una condición? (Elige 2)","options":["Un informe","Visibilidad condicional del componente","Un perfil distinto para cada usuario del flujo","Separar en otra pantalla tras una Decisión","Una regla de validación en el objeto del registro"],"correct":[1,3],"explanation":"Conditional visibility o pantallas separadas con decisión.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two options make a screen field appear only when a condition holds? (Choose 2)","options":["A report","Component conditional visibility","A different profile per flow user","Splitting into another screen after a Decision","A validation rule on the record's object"],"explanation":"Conditional visibility or separate screens after a decision."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué es una plantilla de texto en Flow?","options":["Un correo de Lightning ya guardado en la organización","Un elemento de decisión","Una variable numérica","Texto con formato y variables para correos o publicaciones"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Text templates combinan texto y recursos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What is a text template in Flow?","options":["A saved Lightning email in the org","A decision element","A number variable","Formatted text with variables for emails or posts"],"explanation":"Text templates combine text and resources."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué orden general sigue Salesforce al guardar un registro?","options":["Solo validaciones","Validaciones del sistema, before-save, triggers before, validaciones personalizadas, guardado, triggers after, after-save","Informes y luego flujos","Flujos after-save primero, luego reglas de validación y por último el guardado"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"El orden de ejecución ordena validaciones, flujos, triggers, asignación, escalado y commit.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What general order does Salesforce follow when saving a record?","options":["Validation only","System validation, before-save, before triggers, custom validation, save, after triggers, after-save","Reports then flows","After-save flows first, then validation rules and finally save"],"explanation":"The order of execution sequences validations, flows, triggers, assignment, escalation and commit."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué automatización se ejecuta después de los flujos after-save en el orden de ejecución?","options":["Reglas de asignación, respuesta automática y escalado","Los flujos before-save","Reglas de validación personalizadas del registro","Las reglas de duplicados"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Assignment, auto-response y escalation rules van tras los triggers after.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which automation runs after triggers in the order of execution?","options":["Assignment, auto-response and escalation rules","Before-save flows","Custom validation rules on the record","Duplicate rules"],"explanation":"Assignment, auto-response and escalation rules run after after-triggers."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de flujo puede usar un sitio de Experience Cloud para usuarios invitados, como un formulario de contacto?","options":["Flujo de orquestación","Flujo de pantalla","Flujo desencadenado por registro before-save","Flujo programado"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Screen flows pueden incrustarse en páginas de Experience Cloud.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which flow type can an Experience Cloud site use for guests, like a contact form?","options":["Orchestration flow","Screen flow","Before-save record-triggered flow","Scheduled flow"],"explanation":"Screen flows can be embedded in Experience Cloud pages."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"Un administrador quiere probar un flujo desencadenado por registro sin crear datos reales. ¿Qué usa?","options":["Un informe","Pruebas de flujo (Flow Tests) o depuración con rollback","Ejecutarlo en producción y borrar los datos después","Un panel"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Flow Tests y Debug con Run in rollback mode evitan cambios permanentes.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"An admin wants to test a record-triggered flow without creating real data. What do they use?","options":["A report","Flow Tests or debug in rollback mode","Run it in production and delete data afterwards","A dashboard"],"explanation":"Flow Tests and Debug in rollback mode avoid permanent changes."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos acciones de flujo interactúan con aprobaciones? (Elige 2)","options":["Borrar el historial de aprobación","Crear un rol temporal para el aprobad