low","Que se convierten solas en Apex","Que son la herramienta preferida para automatizaciones nuevas"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Workflow Rules y Process Builder dejaron de recibir soporte; hay que migrar.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A company still uses workflow rules. What should the admin know?","options":["Nothing","Salesforce retired their support and recommends migrating to Flow","They auto-convert to Apex","They're the preferred tool for new automation"],"explanation":"Workflow Rules and Process Builder lost support; migrate."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ventaja tiene un subflujo?","options":["Que se ejecuta siempre más rápido que cualquier otro tipo de flujo","Reutilizar lógica en varios flujos","Nada","Evitar límites"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Los subflows encapsulan lógica reutilizable.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's the advantage of a subflow?","options":["It always runs faster than any other flow type","Reusing logic across flows","Nothing","Avoiding limits"],"explanation":"Subflows encapsulate reusable logic."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos herramientas declarativas pueden actualizar un campo automáticamente al cumplirse una condición? (Elige 2)","options":["Reglas de validación","Acciones de un proceso de aprobación","Tipos de informe personalizados","Listas de selección dependientes","Flujo desencadenado por registro"],"correct":[1,4],"explanation":"Flujos y field updates de aprobaciones cambian campos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two declarative tools can auto-update a field when a condition holds? (Choose 2)","options":["Validation rules","Approval process actions","Custom report types","Dependent picklists","Record-triggered flow"],"explanation":"Flows and approval field updates change fields."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"Un flujo debe ejecutarse cuando se borra un registro para registrar quién lo borró. ¿Qué configura?","options":["Una regla de validación al borrar","Un flujo desencadenado por registro al borrar (before-delete)","Data Export","Un flujo programado cada hora que busque borrados"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Los flujos se pueden disparar al eliminar un registro.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A flow must run when a record is deleted to log who deleted it. What's configured?","options":["A validation rule on delete","A record-triggered flow on delete (before-delete)","Data Export","An hourly scheduled flow searching for deletions"],"explanation":"Flows can trigger when a record is deleted."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué es una acción invocable (invocable action) en Flow?","options":["Un informe","Un flujo que solo puede ejecutar el administrador del sistema","Una regla de validación","Una acción, a menudo de Apex o estándar, que el flujo llama"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Las acciones invocables amplían Flow con lógica adicional.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What is an invocable action in Flow?","options":["A report","A flow only the system admin can run","A validation rule","An action, often Apex or standard, that the flow calls"],"explanation":"Invocable actions extend Flow with extra logic."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué indica el error de flujo \"too many SOQL queries\"?","options":["Que falta un perfil","Que el usuario no tiene licencia","Que el flujo tiene demasiadas pantallas","Se hacen consultas Get Records dentro de un bucle"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Las consultas en bucles agotan el límite de 100 SOQL.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does the flow error \"too many SOQL queries\" indicate?","options":["A profile is missing","The user has no license","The flow has too many screens","Get Records queries inside a loop"],"explanation":"Queries in loops exhaust the 100 SOQL limit."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué recomienda Salesforce para evitar recursividad en flujos que actualizan el mismo objeto?","options":["Desactivar todos los demás flujos del objeto en producción","Usar siempre Apex","Condiciones de entrada precisas y ejecutar solo cuando cambia lo relevante","Nada"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Condiciones y la opción de ejecutar solo al cumplirse evitan bucles.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does Salesforce recommend to avoid recursion in flows updating the same object?","options":["Disabling every other flow on the object in production","Always using Apex","Precise entry conditions and running only when relevant fields change","Nothing"],"explanation":"Conditions and run-only-when-met avoid loops."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"Al aprobarse una oportunidad debe cambiar su etapa. ¿Dónde se configura en el proceso de aprobación?","options":["Una actualización de campo en las acciones de aprobación final","Una regla de escalado en la oportunidad aprobada","El perfil del aprobador","Un informe"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Final approval actions pueden incluir field updates.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"When an opportunity is approved its stage must change. Where in the approval process?","options":["A field update in final approval actions","An escalation rule on the approved opportunity","The approver's profile","A report"],"explanation":"Final approval actions can include field updates."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos herramientas deben elegirse antes que el código según la jerarquía de automatización? (Elige 2)","options":["Flow","Visualforce para formularios sencillos","Apex para todos los requisitos de la organización","Integraciones externas personalizadas","Configuración estándar y reglas de validación"],"correct":[0,4],"explanation":"Clicks before code: configuración y Flow antes que Apex.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two tools should be chosen before code in the automation hierarchy? (Choose 2)","options":["Flow","Visualforce for simple forms","Apex for every org requirement","Custom external integrations","Standard configuration and validation rules"],"explanation":"Clicks before code: configuration and Flow before Apex."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué limita las rutas programadas de un flujo?","options":["Solo en flujos after-save desencadenados por registro","Nada","Que pueden usarse en cualquier tipo de flujo, incluso de pantalla","Que solo admiten horas exactas"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Scheduled paths están en record-triggered flows after-save.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What constrains a flow's scheduled paths?","options":["Only in after-save record-triggered flows","Nothing","They work in any flow type, even screen flows","They only support exact hours"],"explanation":"Scheduled paths live in after-save record-triggered flows."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ventaja tiene el elemento Transformar (Transform) en Flow?","options":["Mapear datos de una colección a otra sin bucles","Convertir un flujo de pantalla en uno programado","Crear informes","Cambiar el objeto de un flujo"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Transform mapea y agrega datos entre estructuras.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's the advantage of the Transform element in Flow?","options":["Mapping data from one collection to another without loops","Converting a screen flow into a scheduled one","Creating reports","Changing a flow's object"],"explanation":"Transform maps and aggregates data between structures."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué indica una entrevista de flujo en pausa (paused interview)?","options":["Nada","Un flujo esperando un evento o tiempo para continuar","Un flujo desactivado","Un flujo con errores que se ha detenido y borrado"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Las entrevistas en pausa esperan para reanudarse.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does a paused flow interview mean?","options":["Nothing","A flow waiting for an event or time to resume","A deactivated flow","A failed flow that stopped and was deleted"],"explanation":"Paused interviews wait to resume."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"Un flujo after-save actualiza el mismo registro que lo disparó. ¿Qué consecuencia tiene?","options":["Puede volver a ejecutar las automatizaciones del objeto","Ninguna, porque las actualizaciones after-save no generan transacciones","Se borra el registro","Bloquea el registro"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Actualizar el mismo registro en after-save lanza otro guardado; mejor before-save.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"An after-save flow updates the same record that triggered it. What's the consequence?","options":["It can re-run the object's automations","None, since after-save updates create no transaction","The record is deleted","It locks the record"],"explanation":"Updating the same record after-save triggers another save; prefer before-save."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de flujo es adecuado para un asistente de alta de cliente que el agente rellena en varias pantallas?","options":["Flujo de pantalla","Flujo autolanzado llamado desde un trigger","Flujo de evento de plataforma","Flujo programado"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Screen flows guían al usuario.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which flow type suits a multi-screen customer onboarding wizard the agent fills in?","options":["Screen flow","Autolaunched flow called from a trigger","Platform event flow","Scheduled flow"],"explanation":"Screen flows guide the user."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos datos muestra el correo de error de un flujo? (Elige 2)","options":["El elemento que falló","Los valores de las variables en la ejecución","Las reglas de colaboración","El OWD del objeto","La jerarquía de roles del usuario"],"correct":[0,1],"explanation":"El email de error incluye la ruta y valores.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two details does a flow error email show? (Choose 2)","options":["The failed element","Variable values during the run","Sharing rules","Object OWD","The user's role hierarchy"],"explanation":"The error email includes the path and values."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de flujo se usa para responder a la creación de un registro en tiempo real y llamar a un sistema externo sin bloquear el guardado?","options":["Flujo de pantalla","Before-save con una llamada HTTP inmediata","Regla de validación","After-save con ruta asíncrona (Run Asynchronously)"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"La ruta asíncrona permite callouts tras confirmar.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which flow handles real-time record creation and calls an external system without blocking the save?","options":["Screen flow","Before-save with an immediate HTTP call","Validation rule","After-save with an asynchronous path (Run Asynchronously)"],"explanation":"The async path allows callouts after commit."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué es la acción HTTP Callout en Flow?","options":["Cambiar el OWD","Llamar a una API externa sin código configurando una credencial con nombre","Enviar un correo con los datos del flujo","Ejecutar un informe"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"HTTP Callout usa Named Credentials para llamar APIs REST.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What is the HTTP Callout action in Flow?","options":["Changing OWD","Calling an external API without code using a named credential","Emailing the flow's data","Running a report"],"explanation":"HTTP Callout uses Named Credentials to call REST APIs."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos riesgos tiene ejecutar un flujo en contexto de sistema sin compartir? (Elige 2)","options":["Que no pueda enviar correos","Que no pueda consultar registros","Puede exponer datos en pantallas si no se controla","Puede leer o cambiar registros a los que el usuario no tiene acceso","Que el flujo falle siempre por falta de permisos"],"correct":[2,3],"explanation":"System context ignora colaboración; hay que diseñarlo con cuidado.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two risks does running a flow in system context without sharing have? (Choose 2)","options":["It can't send emails","It can't query records","It can expose data on screens if unchecked","It can read or change records the user can't access","The flow always fails for lack of permissions"],"explanation":"System context ignores sharing; design carefully."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"Un administrador debe actualizar 50 oportunidades relacionadas al cerrar una cuenta. ¿Qué patrón usa en el flujo?","options":["Data Loader manual","Cincuenta flujos diferentes","Un Update Records dentro del bucle por cada oportunidad","Get Records, bucle con Asignación a una colección y un único Update Records"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"O un único Update Records con filtro, sin bucle.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"An admin must update 50 related opportunities when an account closes. Which flow pattern?","options":["Manual Data Loader","Fifty different flows","An Update Records inside the loop per opportunity","Get Records, loop with Assignment to a collection and one Update Records"],"explanation":"Or a single filtered Update Records with no loop."}}},{"domain":"D7","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué elemento de flujo puede actualizar varios registros que cumplen un filtro sin consultarlos antes?","options":["Actualizar registros con condiciones","Asignación con filtro","Decisión","Pantalla"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Update Records puede especificar condiciones y valores directamente.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which flow element updates multiple records matching a filter without querying first?","options":["Update Records with conditions","Assignment with filter","Decision","Screen"],"explanation":"Update Records can specify conditions and values directly."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué es un agente de Agentforce?","options":["Un usuario humano con licencia de soporte que atiende chats de clientes","Un flujo de pantalla que se lanza desde la barra de utilidades","Un informe programado que resume la actividad comercial de la semana","Un asistente de IA que razona y ejecuta acciones"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Los agentes usan un motor de razonamiento, temas, instrucciones y acciones.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What is an Agentforce agent?","options":["A licensed human support user who handles customer chats","A screen flow launched from the utility bar","A scheduled report summarizing the week's sales activity","An AI assistant that reasons and executes actions"],"explanation":"Agents use a reasoning engine, topics, instructions and actions."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Dónde configura un administrador temas, instrucciones y acciones de un agente?","options":["En Agentforce Builder","En Schema Builder, añadiendo el agente como objeto relacionado","En el Object Manager, dentro de cada objeto que use el agente","En la configuración de la empresa (Company Information)"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Agentforce Builder (antes Agent Builder) centraliza la configuración del agente.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Where does an admin configure an agent's topics, instructions and actions?","options":["In Agentforce Builder","In Schema Builder, adding the agent as a related object","In Object Manager, within each object the agent uses","In Company Information settings"],"explanation":"Agentforce Builder (formerly Agent Builder) centralizes agent setup."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué es un tema (topic) en un agente?","options":["Un campo de lista de selección que clasifica casos según su asunto","Una categoría de trabajo con instrucciones y acciones","Un grupo de Chatter donde los usuarios comentan las respuestas del agente","Una carpeta de informes compartida con los supervisores"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Los topics agrupan lo que el agente puede hacer y cómo.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What is a topic in an agent?","options":["A picklist field classifying cases by subject","A job category with instructions and actions","A Chatter group where users comment on the agent's answers","A report folder shared with supervisors"],"explanation":"Topics group what the agent can do and how."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Para qué sirven las instrucciones de un tema?","options":["Guiar cómo razona y responde el agente en ese tema","Definir qué perfiles de usuario pueden ver los registros del tema","Programar la hora a la que el agente se ejecuta cada día","Traducir automáticamente los campos del objeto relacionado"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Las instrucciones en lenguaje natural orientan el comportamiento.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What are a topic's instructions for?","options":["Guiding how the agent reasons and responds in that topic","Defining which user profiles can see the topic's records","Scheduling when the agent runs each day","Auto-translating the related object's fields"],"explanation":"Natural-language instructions steer behavior."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tres tipos de recursos pueden ser acciones de un agente sin escribir código nuevo? (Elige 2)","options":["Carpetas de paneles compartidas","Plantillas de prompt","Reglas de validación de los objetos estándar","Diseños de página asignados a perfiles","Flujos"],"correct":[1,4],"explanation":"Las acciones pueden ser flujos, prompt templates, Apex invocable o acciones estándar.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which resources can be agent actions without writing new code? (Choose 2)","options":["Shared dashboard folders","Prompt templates","Standard object validation rules","Page layouts assigned to profiles","Flows"],"explanation":"Actions can be flows, prompt templates, invocable Apex or standard actions."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué determina qué datos puede leer o cambiar un agente de servicio que atiende a clientes?","options":["Los permisos del usuario con el que se ejecuta el agente","La zona horaria del cliente que escribe en el chat del sitio web","El número de temas que tenga el agente en Agentforce Builder","El idioma predeterminado configurado en la información de la empresa"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Los agentes de servicio se ejecutan con un usuario de agente y sus permission sets.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What determines which data a customer-facing service agent can read or change?","options":["The permissions of the user the agent runs as","The time zone of the customer chatting on the website","The number of topics the agent has in Agentforce Builder","The default language in Company Information"],"explanation":"Service agents run as an agent user with its permission sets."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"Un agente de empleados (asistente interno) actúa en nombre del usuario. ¿Con qué permisos?","options":["Con los del usuario de integración de la organización","Con permisos de sistema completos para todos los objetos","Con los del administrador que creó el agente en la organización","Con los del usuario que lo usa"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Los agentes de empleados respetan el acceso del usuario que interactúa.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"An employee agent (internal assistant) acts on the user's behalf. With what permissions?","options":["Those of the org's integration user","Full system permissions on every object","Those of the admin who created the agent in the org","Those of the user using it"],"explanation":"Employee agents honor the interacting user's access."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué capa de Salesforce protege los datos cuando se envían a modelos de IA, con enmascaramiento y retención cero?","options":["Las reglas de colaboración basadas en criterios","El Setup Audit Trail con historial de 180 días","El servicio de exportación semanal de datos","Einstein Trust Layer"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"La Trust Layer aplica anclaje seguro, enmascaramiento, detección de toxicidad y zero data retention.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which Salesforce layer protects data sent to AI models with masking and zero retention?","options":["Criteria-based sharing rules","Setup Audit Trail with 180-day history","The weekly data export service","Einstein Trust Layer"],"explanation":"The Trust Layer applies secure grounding, masking, toxicity detection and zero data retention."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué herramienta permite al administrador conversar con el agente antes de activarlo para comprobar su comportamiento?","options":["La vista previa de conversación de Agentforce Builder","El historial de inicios de sesión del usuario del agente","Un informe de casos cerrados por el agente durante el último mes","El modo de depuración de los flujos de pantalla en producción"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Conversation Preview muestra el razonamiento, el tema elegido y las acciones.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which tool lets the admin chat with the agent before activation to check behavior?","options":["Agentforce Builder's conversation preview","The agent user's login history","A report of cases closed by the agent last month","Screen flow debug mode in production"],"explanation":"Conversation Preview shows reasoning, chosen topic and actions."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué herramienta prueba un agente con muchas frases de usuario en lote y compara resultados esperados?","options":["El Import Wizard de leads","Un panel dinámico con métricas de satisfacción","Data Loader cargando las frases como registros de caso","Agentforce Testing Center"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Testing Center ejecuta casos de prueba sobre temas y acciones.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which tool tests an agent with many user utterances in batch and compares expected results?","options":["The leads Import Wizard","A dynamic dashboard with satisfaction metrics","Data Loader loading utterances as case records","Agentforce Testing Center"],"explanation":"Testing Center runs test cases on topics and actions."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"Un agente elige el tema equivocado para una consulta. ¿Qué se revisa primero?","options":["El número de licencias de la organización","La zona horaria del usuario del agente","La descripción y el ámbito de los temas","El OWD del objeto caso y las reglas de colaboración"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"El motor de razonamiento clasifica con la descripción (classification description) y el alcance del tema.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"An agent picks the wrong topic for a query. What's checked first?","options":["The org's license count","The agent user's time zone","Topic descriptions and scope","Case object OWD and sharing rules"],"explanation":"The reasoning engine classifies using topic description and scope."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos buenas prácticas mejoran las instrucciones de un tema? (Elige 2)","options":["Indicar cuándo usar cada acción","Ser claras y específicas","Escribirlas lo más largas posible repitiendo cada idea varias veces","Mezclar en un solo tema todas las tareas del departamento","Evitar mencionar las acciones disponibles"],"correct":[0,1],"explanation":"Instrucciones concisas, específicas y que guíen la elección de acciones.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two practices improve topic instructions? (Choose 2)","options":["Say when to use each action","Be clear and specific","Make them as long as possible, repeating each idea","Mix all department tasks into one topic","Avoid mentioning available actions"],"explanation":"Concise, specific instructions that guide action choice."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué es una plantilla de prompt (prompt template)?","options":["Una plantilla de correo electrónico Classic con campos de combinación","Un tipo de informe personalizado con columnas fijas","Un prompt reutilizable con datos de Salesforce","Un diseño de página para la app móvil"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Prompt Builder crea plantillas ancladas en registros, flujos o datos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What is a prompt template?","options":["A Classic email template with merge fields","A custom report type with fixed columns","A reusable prompt grounded in Salesforce data","A mobile app page layout"],"explanation":"Prompt Builder creates templates grounded in records, flows or data."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Con qué herramienta se crean y prueban las plantillas de prompt?","options":["Prompt Builder","Lightning App Builder en la página de inicio de cada usuario","El editor de plantillas de correo Classic","Report Builder con fórmulas de resumen"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Prompt Builder permite crear, anclar y previsualizar respuestas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which tool creates and tests prompt templates?","options":["Prompt Builder","Lightning App Builder on each user's Home page","The Classic email template editor","Report Builder with summary formulas"],"explanation":"Prompt Builder lets you create, ground and preview responses."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué significa anclar (grounding) un prompt?","options":["Traducir el prompt a todos los idiomas activos de la organización","Incluir datos relevantes del cliente o registro","Guardar una copia del prompt en una biblioteca de archivos","Bloquear el prompt para que ningún administrador pueda editarlo"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"El grounding aporta contexto de datos para respuestas precisas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does grounding a prompt mean?","options":["Translating the prompt into all active org languages","Including relevant customer or record data","Saving a prompt copy in a file library","Locking the prompt so no admin can edit it"],"explanation":"Grounding supplies data context for accurate responses."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué permiso suelen necesitar los usuarios para usar Agentforce para empleados?","options":["Un conjunto de permisos de Agentforce asignado","La casilla Marketing User en su registro de usuario","El perfil de administrador del sistema con Modify All Data","Un rol situado en la parte superior de la jerarquía"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Se asignan permission sets específicos de Agentforce/Einstein.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What do users usually need to use Agentforce for employees?","options":["An assigned Agentforce permission set","The Marketing User checkbox on their user record","The System Administrator profile with Modify All Data","A role at the top of the hierarchy"],"explanation":"Specific Agentforce/Einstein permission sets are assigned."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué debe ocurrir para que un agente de servicio funcione en el chat de la web?","options":["Crear una cola de leads con todos los agentes humanos","Cambiar el OWD de casos a lectura/escritura pública","Publicar un informe en el sitio web público de la empresa","Activarlo y conectarlo a un canal de mensajería"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Los agentes se despliegan en canales como Messaging for In-App and Web mediante Omni-Channel.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What must happen for a service agent to work in the website chat?","options":["Create a lead queue with all human agents","Change case OWD to public read/write","Publish a report on the company's public website","Activate it and connect it to a messaging channel"],"explanation":"Agents deploy to channels like Messaging for In-App and Web via Omni-Channel."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"Un cliente pide hablar con una persona. ¿Qué debe permitir la configuración del agente?","options":["Repetir la última respuesta hasta que el cliente desista","Cerrar la conversación y abrir un caso sin avisar al cliente","Enviar al cliente un enlace al informe de casos abiertos","Escalar o transferir a un agente humano"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"La acción de escalado transfiere a una cola de Omni-Channel.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A customer asks to talk to a person. What should the agent setup allow?","options":["Repeating the last answer until the customer gives up","Closing the chat and opening a case without telling the customer","Sending the customer a link to the open-cases report","Escalating or transferring to a human agent"],"explanation":"The escalation action transfers to an Omni-Channel queue."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos riesgos mitiga la Einstein Trust Layer? (Elige 2)","options":["Que el administrador borre campos personalizados por error","Que la organización supere el límite de almacenamiento","Respuestas tóxicas","Que los usuarios olviden su contraseña de inicio de sesión","Exposición de datos sensibles al modelo"],"correct":[2,4],"explanation":"Enmascara PII, detecta toxicidad y registra en auditoría.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two risks does the Einstein Trust Layer mitigate? (Choose 2)","options":["Admins deleting custom fields by mistake","The org exceeding storage limits","Toxic responses","Users forgetting their login password","Sensitive data exposure to the model"],"explanation":"It masks PII, detects toxicity and logs for audit."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Dónde puede revisar el administrador qué prompts y respuestas generó la IA para auditoría?","options":["En el historial de campos del objeto cuenta","En la lista de inicios de sesión de cada usuario","En los datos de auditoría y feedback de IA","En la papelera de reciclaje de la organización"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Los datos de auditoría y feedback se almacenan (en Data Cloud) para revisión.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Where can the admin review AI-generated prompts and responses for audit?","options":["In the account object's field history","In each user's login list","In AI audit and feedback data","In the org recycle bin"],"explanation":"Audit and feedback data are stored (in Data Cloud) for review."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"Un agente debe consultar el estado de un pedido. ¿Cómo se le da esa capacidad sin código Apex nuevo?","options":["Una acción basada en un flujo autolanzado","Un informe matricial de pedidos por estado","Una regla de validación sobre el objeto pedido","Un tipo de registro de pedido exclusivo para el agente"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Un autolaunched flow con entradas y salidas puede ser una acción del agente.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"An agent must check an order's status. How is that capability added without new Apex?","options":["An action based on an autolaunched flow","A matrix report of orders by status","A validation rule on the order object","An order record type exclusive to the agent"],"explanation":"An autolaunched flow with inputs and outputs can be an agent action."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ayuda al agente a decidir cuándo usar una acción?","options":["El orden alfabético de las acciones en el tema","El color asignado a la acción en el constructor","El número de registros que devuelve la acción","Las instrucciones y la descripción de la acción"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"El razonamiento usa descripciones de acción, entradas y salidas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What helps the agent decide when to use an action?","options":["Alphabetical order of actions in the topic","The color assigned to the action in the builder","The number of records the action returns","The action's instructions and description"],"explanation":"Reasoning uses action descriptions, inputs and outputs."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué opción hace que una acción pida confirmación al usuario antes de ejecutarse?","options":["Requerir confirmación del usuario en la acción","Añadir una regla de validación sobre el registro afectado","Asignar la acción a un perfil de solo lectura","Desactivar el tema mientras se ejecuta la acción"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Las acciones pueden marcarse para pedir confirmación.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which option makes an action ask for user confirmation before running?","options":["Require user confirmation on the action","Add a validation rule on the affected record","Assign the action to a read-only profile","Deactivate the topic while the action runs"],"explanation":"Actions can be flagged to require confirmation."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos fuentes puede usar un agente para responder preguntas con conocimiento de la empresa? (Elige 2)","options":["Las contraseñas almacenadas de los usuarios","El Setup Audit Trail de los últimos seis meses","Datos recuperados de Data Cloud (RAG)","Artículos de Knowledge","El historial de inicios de sesión"],"correct":[2,3],"explanation":"Knowledge y recuperadores de Data Cloud aportan contexto (RAG).","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two sources can an agent use to answer with company knowledge? (Choose 2)","options":["Users' stored passwords","Setup Audit Trail for the last six months","Data retrieved from Data Cloud (RAG)","Knowledge articles","Login history"],"explanation":"Knowledge and Data Cloud retrievers provide context (RAG)."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué recomienda Salesforce antes de desplegar un agente en producción?","options":["Dar al usuario del agente View All Data","Probarlo en sandbox y con casos de prueba","Activarlo para todos los clientes y corregir los errores según las quejas","Desactivar la Trust Layer para mejorar la velocidad"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Probar en sandbox, con Testing Center, antes de producción.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does Salesforce recommend before deploying an agent to production?","options":["Giving the agent user View All Data","Testing it in a sandbox with test cases","Activating it for all customers and fixing based on complaints","Disabling the Trust Layer to boost speed"],"explanation":"Test in a sandbox with Testing Center before production."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué principio de seguridad se aplica al usuario de un agente de servicio?","options":["Compartir el usuario con los agentes humanos del equipo","Acceso total para evitar errores de permisos en las acciones","Mínimo privilegio","Asignarle el perfil de administrador del sistema"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Solo los permisos necesarios para sus acciones.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which security principle applies to a service agent's user?","options":["Sharing the user with the team's human agents","Full access to avoid permission errors in actions","Least privilege","Assigning the System Administrator profile"],"explanation":"Only the permissions its actions need."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué indica la sección de razonamiento en la vista previa del agente?","options":["El tema elegido y las acciones ejecutadas","Las reglas de colaboración aplicadas al registro","Los usuarios conectados en ese momento","El coste en dólares de cada consulta al modelo"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Permite entender y depurar decisiones del agente.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does the reasoning section in the agent preview show?","options":["The chosen topic and executed actions","Sharing rules applied to the record","Users currently online","The dollar cost of each model query"],"explanation":"It helps understand and debug agent decisions."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de agente atiende a clientes en canales externos?","options":["Agente de despliegue de metadatos","Agente de informes programados para directores","Agente de servicio (Service Agent)","Agente de empleados que usa los permisos del administrador"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Los service agents atienden a clientes; los employee agents, a usuarios internos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which agent type serves customers on external channels?","options":["Metadata deployment agent","Scheduled reporting agent for managers","Service Agent","Employee agent using the admin's permissions"],"explanation":"Service agents serve customers; employee agents serve internal users."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué limitación conviene incluir en las instrucciones de un agente de servicio?","options":["Qué temas no debe tratar","Que nunca escale a una persona","Que responda con la mayor longitud posible siempre","Que ignore las preguntas sobre pedidos"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Las barreras (guardrails) delimitan el alcance del agente.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which limitation should a service agent's instructions include?","options":["Which topics it must not handle","Never escalate to a person","Always answer as long as possible","Ignore order questions"],"explanation":"Guardrails bound the agent's scope."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos elementos definen una acción de agente? (Elige 2)","options":["El OWD del objeto relacionado con la acción","Entradas y salidas","Instrucciones de la acción","La carpeta de informes del agente","El tipo de registro predeterminado del usuario"],"correct":[1,2],"explanation":"Una acción tiene referencia, instrucciones, entradas y salidas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two elements define an agent action? (Choose 2)","options":["The OWD of the action's related object","Inputs and outputs","Action instructions","The agent's report folder","The user's default record type"],"explanation":"An action has a reference, instructions, inputs and outputs."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué métrica ayuda a valorar si un agente resuelve consultas sin intervención humana?","options":["Espacio de almacenamiento de archivos","Tasa de resolución o contención","Número de perfiles activos","Número de campos personalizados del objeto caso"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Las analíticas de Agentforce miden contención, escalados y feedback.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which metric helps judge whether an agent resolves queries without human help?","options":["File storage usage","Resolution or containment rate","Number of active profiles","Number of custom fields on case"],"explanation":"Agentforce analytics measure containment, escalations and feedback."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"Un tema debe recibir datos del registro que el usuario está viendo. ¿Qué lo hace posible en un agente de empleados?","options":["Una regla de colaboración específica para el agente","Una cola de registros","Un informe con filtro por usuario","El contexto del registro de la página"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Los agentes en Lightning reciben el contexto de registro actual.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A topic needs the record the user is viewing. What enables it for an employee agent?","options":["An agent-specific sharing rule","A record queue","A report filtered by user","The page's record context"],"explanation":"Lightning agents receive current record context."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué permite el feedback de los usuarios (pulgar arriba/abajo) en respuestas de IA?","options":["Mejorar instrucciones y analizar calidad","Borrar la conversación del historial","Cambiar automáticamente el modelo de lenguaje de la organización","Bloquear al usuario que da el pulgar abajo"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"El feedback se almacena para revisión y ajuste.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does user feedback (thumbs up/down) on AI responses allow?","options":["Improving instructions and analyzing quality","Deleting the conversation from history","Automatically changing the org's language model","Blocking the thumbs-down user"],"explanation":"Feedback is stored for review and tuning."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dato no debería incluirse en las instrucciones de un agente?","options":["Cuándo escalar a una persona","El tono de las respuestas","La descripción del tipo de consultas que atiende","Credenciales o secretos"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Las instrucciones nunca deben contener secretos; los permisos y credenciales se gestionan aparte.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which item should never go in an agent's instructions?","options":["When to escalate to a person","The tone of responses","A description of the queries it handles","Credentials or secrets"],"explanation":"Instructions must never hold secrets; permissions and credentials are managed separately."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos acciones estándar suelen incluir los agentes de empleados? (Elige 2)","options":["Borrar usuarios de la organización","Consultar registros","Crear sandboxes","Resumir un registro","Cambiar el OWD de un objeto"],"correct":[1,3],"explanation":"Acciones estándar: resumir, buscar, consultar, redactar, actualizar registros.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two standard actions do employee agents typically include? (Choose 2)","options":["Delete org users","Query records","Create sandboxes","Summarize a record","Change an object's OWD"],"explanation":"Standard actions: summarize, search, query, draft, update records."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"Tras cambiar un tema en un agente activo, ¿qué conviene hacer?","options":["Desactivar la Trust Layer","Borrar todas las conversaciones anteriores","Editar la versión activa directamente en producción sin probar","Crear una nueva versión y volver a probar"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Los agentes se versionan; se prueba antes de activar.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"After changing a topic on an active agent, what should be done?","options":["Disable the Trust Layer","Delete all prior conversations","Edit the active version directly in production untested","Create a new version and retest"],"explanation":"Agents are versioned; test before activating."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué consideración de datos hay al usar Agentforce?","options":["Que los datos se copian a un servidor público de terceros","Ninguna","Requiere Data Cloud para funciones como auditoría o RAG","Que borra los registros tras cada conversación"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Agentforce usa Data Cloud para almacenamiento de auditoría y recuperación.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What data consideration applies when using Agentforce?","options":["Data is copied to a public third-party server","None","It relies on Data Cloud for audit or RAG features","It deletes records after each conversation"],"explanation":"Agentforce uses Data Cloud for audit storage and retrieval."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ventaja tiene usar un flujo existente como acción de agente?","options":["Reutiliza lógica probada y sus permisos","Que no necesita descripción","Que se ejecuta sin respetar ningún límite","Que sustituye a la Trust Layer"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Los flujos aportan lógica determinista al agente.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's the benefit of using an existing flow as an agent action?","options":["Reuses tested logic and its permissions","It needs no description","It runs ignoring any limits","It replaces the Trust Layer"],"explanation":"Flows add deterministic logic to the agent."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué indica el ámbito (scope) de un tema?","options":["El horario en que el tema está activo","Qué puede y qué no puede hacer el agente en él","El idioma del tema","El número de usuarios que pueden ver el tema en el constructor"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"El scope delimita el trabajo del tema.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does a topic's scope indicate?","options":["When the topic is active","What the agent can and can't do in it","The topic's language","How many users see the topic in the builder"],"explanation":"Scope bounds the topic's job."}}},{"domain":"D8","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué herramienta de Setup activa las funciones de IA generativa de Einstein antes de crear agentes?","options":["La sección de horario comercial de la empresa","El asistente de importación de datos de la organización","La configuración de Einstein (Einstein Setup)","La configuración de sesión de los perfiles de usuario"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Hay que activar Einstein generativo en Setup antes de usar Agentforce.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which Setup area turns on Einstein generative AI before creating agents?","options":["Company business hours","The org's data import wizard","Einstein Setup","User profile session settings"],"explanation":"Generative Einstein must be enabled in Setup before using Agentforce."}}}]}$exam$::jsonb);
